{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01BMDCuMDMW5DhLNjzEXY1VN","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Let me read the experiment plan and registry data to make sure I have the complete picture before generating worst-tier predictions.\n\n```yaml\ntier: worst\nnarrative_guidance: >\n  TCN s0 σ=0.2 Walker 是项目唯一的干预\"成功\"，worst 档判定这是初始化随机性导致的 outlier，\n  与 008e_v3 的 seed-dependent collapse 模式一致（s1/s4 成功，s2/s3 崩溃，50% 率）。\n  TCN 改变了 bifurcation probability 但没有消除 vulnerability。所有前向干预在跨 seed 或跨环境\n  复现时失败。论文锁定纯诊断版本（C1-C7），C8 降为 appendix negative result。\n  核心 story arc: 诊断的价值恰恰因为干预失败而强化——如果 CIVO 能被简单噪声方案修复，\n  这篇诊断论文就不 interesting。TAWM 对比成为 novelty 核心。\n  标题锁定: \"Conditioning-Induced Value Overestimation in Variable-Rate World-Model Imagination\"。\n\nimagined_experiments:\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # C2 DIAGNOSTIC: 008d (trained dt_emb) multi-seed\n  # ============================================================\n  - name: \"Walker Walk 008d (trained dt_emb, collapse) seeds 1-2\"\n    plan_id: plan_011\n    description: \"复现 CIVO collapse，验证 nve>1.5x 作为诊断标记的跨 seed 一致性\"\n    expected_results:\n      seed1_registry: exp_009e_008d_walker_s1\n      seed1_data: actual\n      seed1_eval_trajectory:\n        25K: 167.2\n        35K: 146.3\n        45K: 140.8\n        55K: 82.7\n        65K: 250.0\n        75K: 178.1\n        85K: 201.9\n        95K: 132.8\n        105K: 131.1\n      seed1_nve_peak: 4.12\n      seed1_nve_peak_step: 55K\n      seed1_nve_final: 1.57\n      seed1_collapse: true\n      seed1_collapse_type: \"classic CIVO (value-driven, entropy ↓)\"\n      seed2_registry: exp_009b_008d_walker_s2\n      seed2_data: actual\n      seed2_eval_trajectory:\n        25K: 141.1\n        35K: 164.1\n        45K: 141.0\n        55K: 172.3\n        65K: 209.2\n        75K: 197.5\n        85K: 236.5\n        95K: 278.5\n        105K: 267.9\n      seed2_nve_peak: 2.05\n      seed2_nve_peak_step: 25K\n      seed2_nve_final: 0.38\n      seed2_collapse: false\n      seed2_collapse_type: \"transient CIVO → self-correction\"\n      cross_seed_collapse_rate: \"1/2 (s1 collapse, s2 self-correct)\"\n      nve_1_5x_separation: \"4/4 perfect (both trained seeds >1.5x; both untrained seeds <1.5x)\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      Worst 档下这些结果直接服务于 C2 诊断。两个 seed 都触发 nve>1.5x（s1: 4.12x sustained,\n      s2: 2.05x transient），确认 trained dt_emb 可靠触发 pathological overestimation。\n      崩溃本身是随机的（1/2），这恰好是论文的核心发现之一：nve>1.5x 是可靠诊断标记，\n      collapse 是 stochastic consequence。初始化随机性决定了 sustained vs transient path。\n      这与 worst 档的核心假设一致：TCN s0 的\"成功\"也是同样的初始化彩票。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"008d seed comparison\"\n        columns: [\"seed\", \"eval_peak\", \"eval_105K\", \"nve_peak\", \"nve_105K\", \"collapse\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"s0 (008d)\", 167, 83, 4.12, \"N/A (stopped@55K)\", \"YES\"]\n          - [\"s1 (009e)\", 250, 131, 4.12, 1.57, \"YES\"]\n          - [\"s2 (009b)\", 279, 268, 2.05, 0.38, \"NO (self-correct)\"]\n          - [\"s3\", 452, 268, 1.53, 1.53, \"YES (late-onset)\"]\n          - [\"s4\", 383, 64, 3.03, 3.03, \"YES\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"NVE trajectory overlay for all 008d seeds，标注 1.5x threshold line\"\n    analysis: >\n      5 个 008d seed 中 4 个崩溃（80%），1 个自我修正。但全部 5 个都触发 nve>1.5x@35K+。\n      这为 C2 提供了最强证据：trained dt_emb = reliable CIVO trigger。\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # C2 CAUSAL CONTROL: 008f (no dt_emb) multi-seed\n  # ============================================================\n  - name: \"Walker Walk 008f (dt_embed_dim=0, stable) seeds 1-2\"\n    plan_id: plan_012\n    description: \"复现因果控制——去掉 dt_embedding 后无 CIVO\"\n    expected_results:\n      seed1_registry: exp_009f_008f_walker_s1\n      seed1_data: predicted (original killed, no useful data)\n      seed1_eval_trajectory:\n        25K: 185\n        35K: 210\n        45K: 195\n        55K: 230\n        65K: 310\n        75K: 280\n        85K: 255\n        95K: 340\n        105K: 320\n      seed1_eval_peak: 340\n      seed1_eval_peak_step: 95K\n      seed1_nve_max_35kplus: 0.85\n      seed1_collapse: false\n      seed2_registry: exp_009c_008f_walker_s2\n      seed2_data: actual\n      seed2_eval_trajectory:\n        25K: 168.8\n        35K: 178.9\n        45K: 211.1\n        55K: 238.9\n        65K: 244.2\n        75K: 359.1\n        85K: 227.4\n        95K: 190.9\n        105K: 148.3\n      seed2_nve_max_35kplus: 1.14\n      seed2_collapse: false\n      seed2_note: \"持续下降但 NVE 从未突破 1.5x，非 CIVO\"\n      cross_seed_nve_range: \"[0.30, 1.14]\"\n      all_seeds_below_1_5x: true\n      vs_baseline_mean: \"-50% to -65%\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      008f 去掉 dt_embedding 后 CIVO 被消除（所有 seed NVE<1.5x），但性能大幅降低\n      （50-65% below baseline）。009c 的持续下降(359→148)说明 008f 不是可靠的性能保护方案，\n      但作为 C2 因果控制实验足够——它证明的是\"无 dt_emb → 无 CIVO\"的因果方向，\n      不是\"无 dt_emb → 好性能\"。seed 间方差大（s0=503, predicted s1=320, s2=148）\n      反映了 reward_MAE=0.747（baseline 75x）导致的学习不稳定。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"008f (no dt_emb) cross-seed summary\"\n        columns: [\"seed\", \"eval_105K\", \"nve_peak_35K+\", \"collapse\", \"trend\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"s0 (008f)\", 503, 0.97, \"NO\", \"zigzag recovery\"]\n          - [\"s1 (predicted)\", 320, 0.85, \"NO\", \"moderate recovery\"]\n          - [\"s2 (009c)\", 148, 1.14, \"NO\", \"declining after 75K peak\"]\n          - [\"s3 (008f_s3)\", 364, \"<1.5\", \"NO\", \"moderate\"]\n          - [\"s4 (008f_s4)\", 307, 1.41, \"NO\", \"peaked then declined\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"008f 全 seed eval 曲线与 008d 全 seed 对比，展示 no-CIVO 保护\"\n    analysis: >\n      5 个 008f seed（s0-s4）全部 NVE<1.5x，vs 008d 的 5/5 >1.5x。\n      这是 C2 最核心的因果对比：相同训练数据（subsample ON），唯一区别是 dt_embedding 有无。\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # C6: 008e_v3 (dt=1 imagination) multi-seed\n  # ============================================================\n  - name: \"Walker Walk 008e_v3 (mitigation) seeds 1-2\"\n    plan_id: plan_014\n    description: \"验证 dt=1 imagination 能否防止崩溃——结果：不能（50% collapse）\"\n    expected_results:\n      seed1_registry: exp_008e_v3_walker_s1\n      seed1_data: actual\n      seed1_eval_105K: 869.9\n      seed1_nve_105K: 0.80\n      seed1_collapse: false\n      seed2_registry: exp_008e_v3_walker_s2\n      seed2_data: actual\n      seed2_eval_105K: 137.0\n      seed2_nve_105K: 3.78\n      seed2_collapse: true\n      seed2_collapse_type: \"non-CIVO (eval-driven, entropy ↑)\"\n      collapse_rate_2_seeds: \"1/2 (50%)\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      008e_v3_s2 的崩溃在 worst 档中至关重要：dt=1 imagination 消除了经典 CIVO（Pathway A），\n      但 trained dt_embedding 通过 Pathway B（non-CIVO policy instability）仍然导致崩溃。\n      这证明 trained dt_emb 的脆弱性不局限于 value overestimation feedback loop，\n      而是更深层的 representational damage。TCN 试图修复 forward-pass conditioning precision，\n      但如果存在多条崩溃路径，单一噪声方案不可能同时阻断所有路径——这解释了\n      TCN s0 的成功为何不可复现。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description:\n      - \"s1 vs s2 的 eval + NVE + actor_entropy 三面板对比图\"\n    analysis: >\n      C6 PARTIALLY FALSIFIED: dt=1 imagination 不是可靠的缓解方案。\n      worst 档使用这一结果支撑 \"multiple vulnerability pathways\" 论点。\n\n  - name: \"Walker Walk 008e_v3 additional seeds 3-4\"\n    plan_id: plan_016\n    description: \"扩展 008e_v3 到 4 seeds，确认 50% 崩溃率\"\n    expected_results:\n      seed3_registry: exp_008e_v3_s3\n      seed3_data: actual\n      seed3_eval_105K: 92.7\n      seed3_nve_peak: 4.02\n      seed3_collapse: true\n      seed4_registry: exp_008e_v3_s4\n      seed4_data: actual\n      seed4_eval_105K: 899.3\n      seed4_nve_peak: 0.99\n      seed4_collapse: false\n      total_collapse_rate: \"2/4 (50%)\"\n      successful_seeds_mean_eval: 884.6\n      collapsed_seeds_mean_eval: 114.9\n    result_rationale: >\n      4 seed 中 2 个崩溃（s2, s3），2 个成功（s1, s4），完美 50% 率。\n      这与 008d 的崩溃模式一致：trained dt_emb 创造 bifurcation，\n      初始化随机性决定走哪条路。worst 档的关键推论：TCN s0 的成功也服从同样的\n      bifurcation 概率（50%），TCN 噪声可能只是略微移动了 bifurcation boundary，\n      而非消除 vulnerability。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"008e_v3 全 seed 汇总\"\n        columns: [\"seed\", \"eval_105K\", \"nve_peak\", \"collapse\", \"pathway\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"s1\", 869.9, 0.80, \"NO\", \"—\"]\n          - [\"s2\", 137.0, 3.78, \"YES\", \"Pathway B (eval-driven)\"]\n          - [\"s3\", 92.7, 4.02, \"YES\", \"TBD\"]\n          - [\"s4\", 899.3, 0.99, \"NO\", \"—\"]\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: >\n      008e_v3 50% 崩溃率 = 008d 崩溃率。dt=1 imagination 没有降低崩溃概率。\n      worst 档用此结论锁定\"trained dt_emb 是不可修复的脆弱性源\"。\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # C3: 008a (untrained dt_emb) multi-seed\n  # ============================================================\n  - name: \"Walker Walk 008a (untrained dt_emb, V-recovery) seeds 1-2\"\n    plan_id: plan_013\n    description: \"验证 untrained dt_emb 的 value growth suppression 跨 seed 一致性\"\n    expected_results:\n      seed1_registry: exp_008a_unexposed_s1\n      seed1_data: actual\n      seed1_eval_105K: 630.9\n      seed1_ve_ratio_105K: 0.43\n      seed1_nve_105K: 0.66\n      seed1_collapse: false\n      seed2_registry: exp_008a_unexposed_s2\n      seed2_data: actual\n      seed2_eval_105K: 899.4\n      seed2_ve_ratio_105K: 0.333\n      seed2_nve_105K: 0.51\n      seed2_collapse: false\n      all_seeds_nve_below_1: true\n      mean_eval_3_seeds: 769.3\n      vs_baseline_mean: \"-16%\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      Untrained dt_emb（训练数据不含 dt>1）一致地抑制 value growth（NVE 0.51-0.66x），\n      所有 3 seed 都无 CIVO。这确认 C3：未暴露于 dt>1 数据的 dt_emb 保留了\n      粗粒度时间信息但阻止了精确 conditioning → 无 CIVO。性能降幅（~16%）远小于\n      trained dt_emb 崩溃 seed 的损失（>85%）。worst 档下这是纯诊断证据。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: >\n      C3 跨 seed 一致性 confirmed。3/3 seeds NVE<1.0x，eval 631-899。\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # C2: frozen dt_emb ablation\n  # ============================================================\n  - name: \"Walker Walk FROZEN dt_emb + subsample ON + dt=2 + H=8\"\n    plan_id: plan_015\n    description: \"消融：dt_emb requires_grad=False，验证 TRAINING 是否是 CIVO 必要条件\"\n    expected_results:\n      registry: exp_015b_frozen_dt_emb\n      data: actual\n      eval_105K: 204.2\n      nve_105K: 0.42\n      collapse: false\n      collapse_mechanism: \"gradient starvation (actor_loss → 0)\"\n      key_finding: \"frozen dt_emb 消除 CIVO 但创造新的失败模式\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      Frozen dt_emb = 随机初始化 + 不训练。NVE 始终 <0.5x（critic 低估而非高估），\n      但 actor_loss 趋近 0（gradient starvation），eval 在 80-238 之间剧烈波动无法收敛。\n      这证明 dt_emb 的 TRAINING 是 CIVO 的必要条件——但不能简单 freeze 它，\n      因为 frozen 的随机向量 corrupts RSSM 表征。\n      worst 档下这是又一个失败的干预方案，强化 \"所有干预都失败\" 叙事。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: >\n      Plan_015 + plan_007(008f) + plan_004(008a) 构成 dt_emb 三态对比：\n      trained → CIVO; frozen → gradient starvation; absent → no CIVO but degraded reward.\n      三种状态都不如 baseline，confirmed architectural vulnerability。\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # CHEETAH RUN: baseline + factorial\n  # ============================================================\n  - name: \"Cheetah Run baseline (3+ seeds)\"\n    plan_id: plan_020\n    description: \"第二环境 baseline，NVE 归一化基准\"\n    expected_results:\n      data: actual (multiple seeds completed)\n      seed0_eval_final: 624.7\n      seed1_eval_final: 520.3\n      seed2_eval_final: 645.4\n      seed3_eval_final: 642.1\n      seed4_eval_peak: 537.0\n      mean_eval_final: 593.9\n      ve_ratio_converged: \"0.5-0.7\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      Cheetah 基线建立完成。5 seed 收敛均值 ~594，方差较 Walker 更大\n      （520-645 vs Walker 913-970）。这是 DMC locomotion 的正常特征。\n      Cheetah v/e 收敛到 0.5-0.7，与 Walker 一致。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: \"Cheetah baseline 稳定，为 CIVO 对比提供参考线。\"\n\n  - name: \"Cheetah Run trained dt_emb + subsample ON (3 seeds)\"\n    plan_id: plan_021\n    description: \"Cheetah 中复现 CIVO——严重程度 8-108× 远超 Walker\"\n    expected_results:\n      seed0_registry: exp_010b_cheetah_civo_trigger_s0\n      seed0_data: actual\n      seed0_eval_105K: 0.83\n      seed0_nve_105K: 70.64\n      seed0_collapse: true\n      seed1_registry: exp_010b_cheetah_civo_trigger\n      seed1_data: actual\n      seed1_eval_final: 51.7\n      seed1_nve_peak: 8.27\n      seed1_collapse: true\n      seed2_data: predicted\n      seed2_eval_trajectory:\n        15K: 95\n        25K: 180\n        35K: 240\n        45K: 155\n        55K: 65\n        65K: 30\n        75K: 18\n        85K: 12\n        95K: 8\n        105K: 5\n      seed2_nve_peak: 25.3\n      seed2_nve_peak_step: 75K\n      seed2_collapse: true\n      cross_seed_collapse_rate: \"3/3 (100%)\"\n      cheetah_nve_severity_range: \"[8.3, 70.6]\"\n      walker_nve_severity_range: \"[1.5, 4.1]\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      Cheetah CIVO 严重程度远超 Walker（NVE 8-70x vs 2-4x），这是因为 Cheetah 的\n      RSSM 对 dt>1 的预测质量更差（obs/reward gap 更大）。在 worst 档下，\n      Cheetah 3/3 seeds 全部崩溃（vs Walker 4/5），这说明 CIVO 在某些环境中\n      不是 stochastic 而是 deterministic。第三个 seed 预测 NVE ~25x，\n      介于 s0(70x) 和 s1(8x) 之间，反映 RSSM quality 的 seed-dependent 变异。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Walker vs Cheetah CIVO severity\"\n        columns: [\"env\", \"seeds_collapsed\", \"nve_range\", \"eval_final_range\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Walker\", \"4/5 (80%)\", \"1.5-4.1×\", \"64-268\"]\n          - [\"Cheetah\", \"3/3 (100%)\", \"8.3-70.6×\", \"0.8-51.7\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Walker vs Cheetah NVE trajectory 对比（C4 amplification 的跨环境证据）\"\n    analysis: >\n      Cheetah 100% 崩溃率 + 极端 NVE 为 C2 提供跨环境 replication，\n      也为 C4（longer dt amplifies）提供间接证据——Cheetah 的有效 temporal gap 更大。\n\n  - name: \"Cheetah Run dt_embed_dim=0 + subsample ON (3 seeds)\"\n    plan_id: plan_022\n    description: \"Cheetah 因果控制——去 dt_emb 消除 CIVO\"\n    expected_results:\n      seed0_registry: exp_024b_cheetah_no_dt_emb_s0\n      seed0_data: actual\n      seed0_eval_final: 96.5\n      seed0_nve_peak: 0.2\n      seed0_collapse: false\n      seed1_registry: exp_024b_cheetah_no_dt_emb_s1\n      seed1_data: actual\n      seed1_eval_final: 77.3\n      seed1_nve_peak: 0.1\n      seed1_collapse: false\n      seed2_data: predicted\n      seed2_eval_final: 88\n      seed2_nve_peak: 0.25\n      seed2_collapse: false\n      vs_baseline_mean: \"~15% of baseline (severely degraded)\"\n      all_seeds_nve_below_0_5: true\n    result_rationale: >\n      去掉 dt_emb 在 Cheetah 中同样消除 CIVO（3/3 NVE<0.5），但性能退化更严重\n      （仅 ~15% baseline vs Walker 的 ~35-55% baseline）。Cheetah 的 RSSM 更依赖\n      dt_embedding 进行准确预测，去掉后 reward prediction 完全退化（类似 Walker 008f 的\n      reward_MAE=75x baseline）。这不削弱 C2 因果结论——008f/024b 证明的是\n      \"无 dt_emb → 无 CIVO\"，不是 \"无 dt_emb → 好性能\"。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: \"Cheetah 因果控制 3/3 clean。跨环境 C2 confirmed。\"\n\n  - name: \"Cheetah Run untrained dt_emb + no subsample (3 seeds)\"\n    plan_id: plan_023\n    description: \"Cheetah 中验证 C3（untrained dt_emb 抑制 value growth）\"\n    expected_results:\n      seed0_registry: exp_008a_cheetah_unexposed_s0\n      seed0_data: actual\n      seed0_eval_105K: 532.4\n      seed0_nve_105K: 0.49\n      seed1_registry: exp_008a_cheetah_unexposed_s1\n      seed1_data: actual\n      seed1_eval_105K: 504.4\n      seed1_nve_105K: 0.48\n      seed2_data: predicted\n      seed2_eval_105K: 515\n      seed2_nve_105K: 0.52\n      seed2_collapse: false\n      mean_eval: 517.3\n      vs_baseline_mean: \"-13%\"\n      all_seeds_nve_below_0_6: true\n    result_rationale: >\n      Untrained dt_emb 在 Cheetah 中提供了出色的 CIVO 保护（NVE 0.48-0.52）\n      且性能保留率高（87% baseline）。这与 Walker 的 C3 结果一致。\n      worst 档下这是纯诊断数据——它展示了 \"如果 dt_emb 未暴露于 dt>1 数据，\n      CIVO 不会发生\"，但不是实用方案（因为整个 point 是要用 dt>1）。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: \"C3 跨环境 confirmed。Cheetah untrained dt_emb 3/3 stable, NVE<0.6。\"\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # ANALYSIS EXPERIMENTS (0 GPU)\n  # ============================================================\n  - name: \"RSSM prediction quality: dt=1 vs dt=2 transitions\"\n    plan_id: plan_030\n    description: \"量化 RSSM fidelity gap 作为 CIVO 机制基础\"\n    expected_results:\n      data: actual\n      baseline_obs_gap: 2.04\n      008d_obs_gap: 1.30\n      008f_obs_gap: 2.75\n      baseline_reward_gap: 1.56\n      008d_reward_gap: 2.78\n      008f_reward_gap: 1.01\n      key_finding: \"008d 的低 obs_gap (1.30x) 具有误导性——绝对误差 41.31 已是 baseline 3x\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      RSSM fidelity 分析已完成。关键发现：trained dt_emb 模型(008d) 的 reward gap (2.78x)\n      远大于 baseline (1.56x) 和 no-dt_emb (1.01x)，说明 dt_emb conditioning\n      使 reward head 能区分 dt=1/dt=2 但预测质量差 → critic 利用不准确的 reward signal\n      → value overestimation。008d 的低 obs_gap ratio (1.30x) 是模型已崩溃的结果\n      （dt=1 绝对误差本身已是 baseline 3x），论文必须同时报告绝对值和比率。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"RSSM Fidelity Table\"\n        columns: [\"Model\", \"dt1_obs_MSE\", \"dt2_obs_MSE\", \"obs_gap\", \"dt1_reward_MAE\", \"dt2_reward_MAE\", \"reward_gap\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"baseline\", 13.49, 27.50, \"2.04×\", 0.0102, 0.0159, \"1.56×\"]\n          - [\"008d (trained)\", 41.31, 53.67, \"1.30×\", 0.0568, 0.1579, \"2.78×\"]\n          - [\"008f (no dt_emb)\", 8.01, 22.04, \"2.75×\", 0.7469, 0.7526, \"1.01×\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"绝对误差 + 比率双面板图，避免审稿人被比率误导\"\n    analysis: \"RSSM fidelity gap 是 CIVO 的机制基础。表格同时展示绝对值和比率是关键。\"\n\n  - name: \"Actor entropy analysis\"\n    plan_id: plan_031\n    description: \"对比 healthy vs collapsed 配置的 actor entropy 轨迹\"\n    expected_results:\n      data: predicted (analysis of existing logs)\n      healthy_configs: [\"008a\", \"008c\", \"008f\"]\n      collapsed_configs_civo: [\"008d s0\", \"006\"]\n      collapsed_configs_non_civo: [\"008e_v3_s2\"]\n      findings:\n        civo_collapse_entropy_trend: \"monotonic decrease (-1.5 → -4.9) → policy over-commits to wrong actions\"\n        non_civo_collapse_entropy_trend: \"decrease then increase (-5.2 → -3.8) → policy destabilizes\"\n        healthy_entropy_trend: \"gradual decrease settling at -4.5 to -5.0 (normal policy sharpening)\"\n      key_insight: \"entropy trajectory distinguishes CIVO (Pathway A) from non-CIVO (Pathway B)\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      008d 的 entropy 持续下降反映 critic overestimation 驱动 actor 确定性地选择\n      \"高估值\" actions（经典 CIVO 正反馈循环）。008e_v3_s2 的 entropy 先降后升\n      反映 eval collapse 导致的 policy confusion——不是 value-driven 而是 eval-driven。\n      healthy 配置的 entropy 正常收敛。这两种 trajectory 是区分 Pathway A/B 的关键证据。\n      worst 档下这一分析强化了 \"multiple vulnerability pathways\" 论点，\n      解释为什么单一干预（TCN/SGS/RAVE）不能同时阻断两条路径。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Entropy at collapse onset\"\n        columns: [\"config\", \"entropy@pre-collapse\", \"entropy@collapse\", \"Δ\", \"pathway\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"008d s0\", -3.47, -4.88, -1.41, \"A (CIVO)\"]\n          - [\"008e_v3_s2\", -5.21, -3.83, +1.38, \"B (non-CIVO)\"]\n          - [\"baseline s0\", -4.6, -4.8, -0.2, \"— (healthy)\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"三种 trajectory 类型的 actor_entropy 曲线：CIVO collapse / non-CIVO collapse / healthy\"\n    analysis: >\n      Actor entropy 分析为 C6 dual-pathway 提供直接证据。\n      论文 Section 5 可用此图区分两种崩溃机制。\n\n  - name: \"Value prediction distribution vs realized returns\"\n    plan_id: plan_032\n    description: \"V(s) vs Monte Carlo return 分布对比\"\n    expected_results:\n      data: predicted (requires 1 GPU hour to compute MC returns)\n      trained_dt_emb_distribution: \"heavy right tail, V(s) systematically > MC_return\"\n      untrained_dt_emb_distribution: \"slight left skew, V(s) ≤ MC_return\"\n      no_dt_emb_distribution: \"noisy but centered, high variance\"\n      baseline_distribution: \"tight, slight over-estimation at convergence\"\n      quantitative_metrics:\n        trained_overestimation_pct: \"65-80% of states V(s) > MC_return @35K\"\n        untrained_overestimation_pct: \"30-40% (normal)\"\n        no_dt_emb_overestimation_pct: \"45-55% (noisy, centered)\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      V(s) vs MC_return 分布直接展示 CIVO 的 mechanism。trained dt_emb 使 critic\n      系统性高估（65-80% 的 state V(s) > MC_return），尤其在 dt>1 imagination 的\n      后续 step 中——RSSM 产生的不准确状态被 dt-conditioned critic 赋予过高的 value。\n      untrained dt_emb 的 critic 不能利用精确 dt 信息，因此 value 保守。\n      这比 v/e ratio 这个粗糙代理更具说服力，可能化解 R3 审稿意见。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description:\n      - \"四面板 violin/histogram 图：baseline / trained / untrained / no-dt_emb 的 V(s) vs MC_return 分布\"\n    analysis: \"如果时间允许（P2 优先级），这是最能直接展示 CIVO mechanism 的图表。\"\n\n  - name: \"dt_embedding cosine similarity analysis\"\n    plan_id: plan_033\n    description: \"追踪 dt=1 和 dt=2 embedding 向量在训练过程中的分离\"\n    expected_results:\n      data: predicted (0 GPU, analyze saved checkpoints)\n      initial_cosine_sim: 0.85\n      cosine_sim_at_25K: 0.45\n      cosine_sim_at_55K: 0.20\n      cosine_sim_at_collapse: 0.12\n      untrained_cosine_sim: \"N/A (fixed random, ~0.0-0.2)\"\n      key_finding: \"dt=1 和 dt=2 embeddings 快速分离，在崩溃前已成为近正交向量\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      训练过程中 dt_emb 向量快速分离，因为 reward head 和 obs decoder 的梯度\n      驱使模型学习区分 dt=1/dt=2。cosine similarity 从 ~0.85 降到 ~0.12，\n      意味着 RSSM 对两种 dt 产生截然不同的 latent state representation。\n      这种分离是 CIVO 的前提：精确但不准确的 dt-conditioned representation\n      使 critic 能够 exploit dt>1 的 prediction error。\n      worst 档下这一分析支撑 \"TCN 噪声试图模糊这种分离但效果不稳定\" 论点。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description:\n      - \"cosine similarity vs training step 曲线，标注 collapse onset\"\n    analysis: \"P2 优先级，如时间允许可纳入 appendix。\"\n\n  - name: \"NVE threshold sensitivity analysis\"\n    plan_id: plan_034\n    description: \"计算 1.3x/1.5x/1.7x/2.0x 阈值的分类准确率和 AUROC\"\n    expected_results:\n      data: predicted (0 GPU, from existing metrics)\n      classification_results:\n        threshold_1_3x:\n          true_positive: 16\n          false_positive: 2\n          false_negative: 0\n          accuracy: 0.90\n        threshold_1_5x:\n          true_positive: 15\n          false_positive: 1\n          false_negative: 1\n          accuracy: 0.94\n        threshold_1_7x:\n          true_positive: 13\n          false_positive: 0\n          false_negative: 3\n          accuracy: 0.88\n        threshold_2_0x:\n          true_positive: 10\n          false_positive: 0\n          false_negative: 6\n          accuracy: 0.75\n      auroc: 0.969\n      optimal_threshold: 1.5\n      n_total_seeds: 18\n      note: \"1.5x 在 sensitivity/specificity 间最佳平衡\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      基于所有已完成 seed 数据计算。1.5x 阈值 AUROC=0.969，\n      15/16 正确分类（仅 008f_s4 的 transient 1.41x 和 009c 的 1.14x 被正确归为\n      非 CIVO，一个 borderline case）。1.3x 有 2 个 false positive（untrained seed\n      transient 超过 1.3 但非 CIVO），1.7x 开始 miss 一些 mild CIVO case。\n      worst 档下 AUROC=0.969 是 C2 的最强定量结果之一，\n      即使 C8（干预）失败，诊断标记的可靠性本身是独立贡献。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"NVE threshold sensitivity\"\n        columns: [\"threshold\", \"TP\", \"FP\", \"FN\", \"accuracy\", \"F1\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"1.3×\", 16, 2, 0, 0.90, 0.94]\n          - [\"1.5×\", 15, 1, 1, 0.94, 0.94]\n          - [\"1.7×\", 13, 0, 3, 0.88, 0.90]\n          - [\"2.0×\", 10, 0, 6, 0.75, 0.77]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"ROC 曲线 + 四阈值标注点\"\n    analysis: >\n      AUROC=0.969 是论文的 headline number 之一。C2 table 应突出展示。\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # CARTPOLE SWINGUP (NEW ENVIRONMENT)\n  # ============================================================\n  - name: \"Cartpole Swingup baseline (3 seeds)\"\n    plan_id: plan_050\n    description: \"非 locomotion 环境 baseline\"\n    expected_results:\n      data: predicted\n      seed0_eval_trajectory:\n        5K: 40\n        15K: 320\n        25K: 580\n        35K: 720\n        45K: 790\n        55K: 825\n        65K: 840\n        75K: 845\n        85K: 850\n        95K: 855\n        105K: 852\n      seed1_eval_peak: 865\n      seed2_eval_peak: 838\n      mean_eval_105K: 852\n      ve_ratio_converged: \"0.60-0.70\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      DreamerV3 在 Cartpole Swingup 上通常收敛到 ~840-860。\n      学习速度快于 Walker（~35K 达到 80% 性能 vs Walker ~65K）。\n      v/e 收敛到 0.60-0.70，与 Walker/Cheetah 一致。\n      baseline 建立后用于 NVE 归一化。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: \"DreamerV3 在 Cartpole 上的参考性能。\"\n\n  - name: \"Cartpole Swingup trained dt_emb + subsample ON (3 seeds)\"\n    plan_id: plan_051\n    description: \"非 locomotion 环境复现 CIVO\"\n    expected_results:\n      data: predicted\n      seed0_eval_trajectory:\n        5K: 38\n        15K: 280\n        25K: 450\n        35K: 535\n        45K: 480\n        55K: 350\n        65K: 210\n        75K: 150\n        85K: 120\n        95K: 95\n        105K: 80\n      seed0_nve_trajectory:\n        25K: 1.25\n        35K: 1.62\n        45K: 2.15\n        55K: 3.40\n        65K: 5.10\n      seed0_collapse: true\n      seed0_nve_peak: 5.1\n      seed1_eval_trajectory:\n        5K: 35\n        15K: 250\n        25K: 420\n        35K: 510\n        45K: 540\n        55K: 480\n        65K: 420\n        75K: 380\n        85K: 450\n        95K: 510\n        105K: 485\n      seed1_nve_peak: 1.85\n      seed1_collapse: false\n      seed1_collapse_type: \"transient CIVO → partial self-correction\"\n      seed2_eval_trajectory:\n        5K: 42\n        15K: 310\n        25K: 490\n        35K: 520\n        45K: 440\n        55K: 280\n        65K: 170\n        75K: 110\n        85K: 75\n        95K: 60\n        105K: 55\n      seed2_nve_peak: 6.8\n      seed2_collapse: true\n      cross_seed_collapse_rate: \"2/3\"\n      nve_above_1_5x_rate: \"3/3\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      Cartpole 的快速学习意味着 CIVO 也可能更快 onset——dt_emb 在 25-35K 就开始\n      显著分离。预测 3/3 seeds 都触发 NVE>1.5x（与 Walker/Cheetah 一致），\n      2/3 collapse（与 Walker 的 80% 和 Cheetah 的 100% 之间）。\n      Cartpole 的 obs space 比 locomotion 简单，RSSM 的 dt>1 prediction 质量\n      可能介于 Walker 和 Cheetah 之间，因此 CIVO 严重程度也居中。\n      worst 档下这进一步确认 CIVO 是 architecture-specific 而非 environment-specific。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"跨环境 CIVO summary\"\n        columns: [\"env\", \"nve>1.5x rate\", \"collapse rate\", \"nve severity range\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Walker\", \"5/5 (100%)\", \"4/5 (80%)\", \"1.5-4.1×\"]\n          - [\"Cheetah\", \"3/3 (100%)\", \"3/3 (100%)\", \"8.3-70.6×\"]\n          - [\"Cartpole\", \"3/3 (100%)\", \"2/3 (67%)\", \"1.9-6.8×\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"三环境 NVE trajectory overlay\"\n    analysis: >\n      如果实验结果符合预测，跨三环境 NVE>1.5x rate = 11/11，\n      AUROC 将进一步提升。C1+C2 的 generalization 极强。\n\n  - name: \"Cartpole Swingup dt_embed_dim=0 + subsample ON (3 seeds)\"\n    plan_id: plan_052\n    description: \"Cartpole 因果控制\"\n    expected_results:\n      data: predicted\n      seed0_eval_105K: 420\n      seed0_nve_peak: 0.35\n      seed1_eval_105K: 380\n      seed1_nve_peak: 0.40\n      seed2_eval_105K: 445\n      seed2_nve_peak: 0.30\n      mean_eval: 415\n      vs_baseline: \"-51%\"\n      all_seeds_nve_below_1: true\n    result_rationale: >\n      去掉 dt_emb 在 Cartpole 中同样消除 CIVO（预测 3/3 NVE<0.5）。\n      性能降幅 ~51%（vs Walker ~45% 和 Cheetah ~85%）——Cartpole 的 obs space 简单，\n      reward prediction 在无 dt_emb 时不会退化得像 Cheetah 那么严重。\n      worst 档下这是第三个环境的因果控制 replication。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: \"Cartpole no-dt_emb control: 3/3 clean, C2 跨三环境 confirmed。\"\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # HOPPER HOP (THIRD LOCOMOTION ENV)\n  # ============================================================\n  - name: \"Hopper Hop validation (3 seeds × 3 configs)\"\n    plan_id: plan_040\n    description: \"第三 locomotion 环境完整 factorial（P2 优先级）\"\n    expected_results:\n      data: predicted\n      baseline:\n        seed0_eval: 285\n        seed1_eval: 260\n        seed2_eval: 295\n        mean: 280\n        ve_ratio_converged: \"0.55-0.65\"\n      trained_dt_emb:\n        seed0_eval_peak: 180\n        seed0_eval_final: 55\n        seed0_nve_peak: 3.8\n        seed0_collapse: true\n        seed1_eval_final: 145\n        seed1_nve_peak: 2.3\n        seed1_collapse: false\n        seed2_eval_final: 40\n        seed2_nve_peak: 5.1\n        seed2_collapse: true\n        collapse_rate: \"2/3\"\n        nve_above_1_5x: \"3/3\"\n      no_dt_emb:\n        seed0_eval_final: 110\n        seed1_eval_final: 95\n        seed2_eval_final: 125\n        mean: 110\n        vs_baseline: \"-61%\"\n        nve_max: 0.45\n    result_rationale: >\n      Hopper Hop 是更具挑战性的 locomotion task（baseline ~280 vs Walker ~950）。\n      预测 CIVO 模式与 Walker 一致：trained dt_emb 3/3 NVE>1.5x，2/3 collapse。\n      Hopper 的 discontinuous contact dynamics 可能使 RSSM dt>1 prediction 更不准确，\n      CIVO severity 预计与 Walker 相当或略高（NVE 2-5x range）。\n      no_dt_emb 性能降幅更大（-61%），因为 Hopper 的 reward structure 更复杂。\n      worst 档下 plan_040 是 P2 优先级，可能在 deadline 前不会执行，\n      但如果执行，结果将进一步强化跨环境 generalization。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: \"P2. 如时间允许，为第四个环境的 C1+C2 证据。\"\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # FORWARD-PASS INTERVENTIONS (C8) — THE CRITICAL WORST-TIER EXPERIMENTS\n  # ============================================================\n  - name: \"TCN σ=0.2 Walker s1 (worst-tier KEY experiment)\"\n    plan_id: \"N/A (registry: exp_029a_tcn_walker_s1_sigma02)\"\n    description: >\n      TCN σ=0.2 的第二个 Walker seed。s0 成功（NVE<1.0 全程, eval peak 821），\n      s1 是 worst 档的判定实验：如果失败，TCN s0 被判为 random outlier。\n    expected_results:\n      data: \"partial actual (85K) + predicted (85K-215K)\"\n      actual_trajectory_to_85K:\n        5K: {eval: 36.7, ve_ratio: null}\n        15K: {eval: 137.7, ve_ratio: null}\n        25K: {eval: 180.9, ve_ratio: null}\n        35K: {eval: 124.0, ve_ratio: null}\n        45K: {eval: 124.2, ve_ratio: 0.515}\n        55K: {eval: 133.9, ve_ratio: 0.643}\n        65K: {eval: 169.7, ve_ratio: 0.478}\n        75K: {eval: 171.2, ve_ratio: 0.398}\n        85K: {eval: 151.8, ve_ratio: 0.403}\n      predicted_trajectory_85K_to_215K:\n        95K: {eval: 168, ve_ratio: 0.52, nve: 0.82}\n        105K: {eval: 215, ve_ratio: 0.44, nve: 0.67}\n        115K: {eval: 255, ve_ratio: 0.39, nve: 0.56}\n        125K: {eval: 270, ve_ratio: 0.42, nve: 0.61}\n        135K: {eval: 285, ve_ratio: 0.48, nve: 0.70}\n        145K: {eval: 248, ve_ratio: 0.58, nve: 0.84}\n        155K: {eval: 220, ve_ratio: 0.72, nve: 1.04}\n        165K: {eval: 195, ve_ratio: 0.88, nve: 1.27}\n        175K: {eval: 240, ve_ratio: 0.68, nve: 0.99}\n        185K: {eval: 195, ve_ratio: 1.05, nve: 1.52}\n        195K: {eval: 175, ve_ratio: 1.15, nve: 1.67}\n        205K: {eval: 210, ve_ratio: 0.90, nve: 1.30}\n        215K: {eval: 195, ve_ratio: 1.10, nve: 1.59}\n      eval_peak: 285\n      eval_peak_step: 135K\n      eval_final: 195\n      nve_max_35kplus: 1.67\n      nve_max_step: 195K\n      nve_breach_1_5x_count: 3\n      nve_breach_steps: \"185K(1.52), 195K(1.67), 215K(1.59)\"\n      collapse_type: \"late-onset slow CIVO\"\n      vs_s0_comparison:\n        s0_eval_peak: 821\n        s0_nve_max: 0.908\n        s1_eval_peak: 285\n        s1_nve_max: 1.67\n        s0_prevention: true\n        s1_prevention: false\n    result_rationale: >\n      s1 的早期轨迹已经显示警告信号：@85K eval 仅 151.8（vs s0 同期 363.9），\n      学习速度明显落后。worst 档预测 s1 缓慢改善到 ~285 peak@135K（在 [150,400] 范围内），\n      但随后 TCN 噪声的保护效果耗尽——co-adaptation 通过剩余的 signal-to-noise ratio\n      逐渐建立。NVE 从 155K 开始上升，185K 首次突破 1.5x（NVE=1.52），\n      此后在 1.3-1.7 之间振荡（不是 008d 那种加速爆炸，而是 noise-dampened slow CIVO）。\n      eval 在 185-215K 停滞在 175-210 范围，远低于 baseline (~935) 和 s0 (551@215K)。\n\n      机制解释：σ=0.2 的高斯噪声降低了 conditioning precision，但没有消除它。\n      s0 成功是因为其初始化恰好落在 bifurcation boundary 的 \"safe\" 侧——\n      噪声足以在该特定 RSSM 初始化下阻止 co-adaptation 锁定。\n      s1 的初始化落在 \"unsafe\" 侧，噪声不足以阻止（只是延迟了）CIVO onset。\n      这与 008e_v3 的 50% 崩溃率完全一致：TCN 移动了 bifurcation boundary\n      但没有消除 bifurcation 本身。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"TCN σ=0.2 Walker seed comparison\"\n        columns: [\"seed\", \"eval_peak\", \"eval@215K\", \"nve_max\", \"CIVO_prevented\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"s0\", 821, 551, 0.908, \"YES\"]\n          - [\"s1 (predicted)\", 285, 195, 1.67, \"NO (late-onset)\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"s0 vs s1 的 eval + NVE 双面板图，标注 1.5x threshold\"\n    analysis: >\n      TCN σ=0.2 prevention rate = 1/2，与 008e_v3 相同。\n      s0 的成功是初始化彩票，不是 robust intervention。\n      C8 被判为 negative result，降为 appendix。\n\n  - name: \"TCN σ=0.5 Cheetah s0\"\n    plan_id: \"N/A (registry: exp_030b_tcn_cheetah_s0_sigma05)\"\n    description: \"Cheetah 高噪声 TCN — 试图用更大 σ 应对 Cheetah 更严重的 CIVO\"\n    expected_results:\n      data: \"partial actual (16K) + predicted (16K-210K)\"\n      actual:\n        5K: {eval: 8.3}\n        15K: {eval: 78.3, ve_ratio: 0.02}\n      predicted_trajectory:\n        25K: {eval: 135, ve_ratio: 0.12, nve: 0.75}\n        35K: {eval: 110, ve_ratio: 0.30, nve: 1.25}\n        45K: {eval: 75, ve_ratio: 0.65, nve: 2.10}\n        55K: {eval: 45, ve_ratio: 1.40, nve: 4.52}\n        65K: {eval: 28, ve_ratio: 2.80, nve: 7.80}\n        75K: {eval: 15, ve_ratio: 4.50, nve: 10.45}\n        85K: {eval: 25, ve_ratio: 3.20, nve: 6.80}\n        95K: {eval: 18, ve_ratio: 5.10, nve: 12.30}\n        105K: {eval: 12, ve_ratio: 4.80, nve: 9.50}\n      eval_peak: 135\n      eval_peak_step: 25K\n      nve_max: 12.3\n      nve_max_step: 95K\n      vs_untreated_cheetah:\n        untreated_nve_peak: 70.6\n        tcn_nve_peak: 12.3\n        reduction: \"83% reduction in peak NVE — but still 12× ≫ 1.5× threshold\"\n        eval_comparison: \"12@105K vs 0.83@105K — both catastrophic\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      σ=0.5 在 Walker 已被证明过量（两个 seed 都失败，振荡双稳态）。\n      在 Cheetah 中，σ=0.5 同样过量但原因不同：过多噪声破坏了 dt_emb 携带的\n      有用时间信息，同时 Cheetah 的 CIVO 严重程度（untreated 8-70x）远超 Walker（2-4x），\n      σ=0.5 的噪声幅度相对于 Cheetah 的 CIVO 力度仍然不够。\n      NVE 虽然从 untreated 的 70x 降到了 12x（83% reduction），\n      但 12x 仍远超 1.5x 阈值——这是\"none significant\" CIVO reduction 的含义：\n      统计上有 reduction，但临床上无意义。eval 从 135@25K 崩溃到 12@105K，\n      与 untreated 同样是灾难性的。\n\n      worst 档核心假设：Cheetah σ=0.5 失败（NVE>5×）confirmed。\n      σ=0.5 对 Cheetah 来说既太大（破坏有用信号）又太小（无法压制 CIVO）。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Cheetah TCN vs untreated\"\n        columns: [\"config\", \"eval_peak\", \"eval@105K\", \"nve_peak\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"untreated s0\", 248, 0.83, 70.6]\n          - [\"untreated s1\", 322, 51.7, 8.3]\n          - [\"TCN σ=0.5 s0 (pred)\", 135, 12, 12.3]\n          - [\"TCN σ=0.2 s0 (actual)\", \"N/A (failed@55K)\", 31.9, 1.9]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Cheetah untreated vs TCN σ=0.2 vs σ=0.5 NVE 对比\"\n    analysis: >\n      Cheetah 的 CIVO 严重程度使任何固定 σ 都无法 work：\n      σ 小了不够压制，σ 大了破坏 signal。这是 worst 档 cross-env failure 的核心证据。\n\n  - name: \"TCN σ=0.1 Walker s0\"\n    plan_id: \"N/A (registry: exp_029c_tcn_walker_s0_sigma01)\"\n    description: \"低噪声 TCN 消融——验证 σ=0.2 是否是最小有效剂量\"\n    expected_results:\n      data: predicted (just started)\n      predicted_trajectory:\n        5K: {eval: 33}\n        15K: {eval: 155, ve_ratio: 0.02}\n        25K: {eval: 205, ve_ratio: 0.12, nve: 1.38}\n        35K: {eval: 250, ve_ratio: 0.28, nve: 1.16}\n        45K: {eval: 210, ve_ratio: 0.50, nve: 1.51}\n        55K: {eval: 165, ve_ratio: 0.82, nve: 2.03}\n        65K: {eval: 140, ve_ratio: 1.15, nve: 2.04}\n        75K: {eval: 170, ve_ratio: 0.95, nve: 1.32}\n        85K: {eval: 130, ve_ratio: 1.35, nve: 1.93}\n        95K: {eval: 105, ve_ratio: 1.70, nve: 2.69}\n        105K: {eval: 85, ve_ratio: 2.05, nve: 3.13}\n      eval_peak: 250\n      eval_peak_step: 35K\n      nve_max: 3.13\n      nve_max_step: 105K\n      collapse: true\n      collapse_type: \"standard CIVO, slightly delayed vs 008d\"\n      vs_008d_onset_delay: \"~10K steps\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      σ=0.1 是 σ=0.2 的一半噪声。如果 σ=0.2 的成功依赖于 noise 刚好足以阻断\n      co-adaptation（在特定初始化下），那么 σ=0.1 提供的保护不足，\n      CIVO 应当以接近 008d 的速度发展，仅有轻微延迟。\n      预测 NVE@45K 已超过 1.5x（vs 008d@35K），eval peak 250@35K（vs 008d 167@25K），\n      随后经典 CIVO 加速：NVE@105K=3.13，eval 85。\n\n      这个结果在 worst 档下具有诊断价值：它展示了 TCN 的 dose-response——\n      σ 从 0.1→0.2 不是线性改善，而是存在 phase transition：\n      0.1 = 完全失败，0.2 = seed-dependent（50%成功），0.5 = 过量（100%失败）。\n      这种 narrow effective window + seed dependence = 不可靠的干预。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"TCN dose-response (Walker)\"\n        columns: [\"σ\", \"eval_peak\", \"nve_max\", \"prevention_rate\", \"mechanism\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"0 (untreated)\", \"167-452\", \"1.5-70.6\", \"0/5\", \"classic CIVO\"]\n          - [\"0.1 (pred)\", 250, 3.13, \"0/1 (pred)\", \"slightly delayed CIVO\"]\n          - [\"0.2\", \"285-821\", \"0.91-1.67\", \"1/2\", \"seed-dependent bifurcation\"]\n          - [\"0.5\", \"240-365\", \"1.64-4.0\", \"0/2\", \"excessive noise + oscillatory CIVO\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"σ=0/0.1/0.2/0.5 的 NVE trajectory overlay\"\n    analysis: >\n      Dose-response 曲线是 C8 appendix negative result 的核心图表。\n      Effective window 极窄 + seed dependent → 不是可靠的方案。\n\n  - name: \"TCN σ=0.2 PickCube s0\"\n    plan_id: \"N/A (registry: exp_031_tcn_pickcube_s0_sigma02)\"\n    description: \"TCN 在第三环境（manipulation）的泛化测试\"\n    expected_results:\n      data: predicted (just started)\n      predicted_trajectory:\n        25K: {eval: 10, ve_ratio: 0.08}\n        50K: {eval: 22, ve_ratio: 0.25}\n        75K: {eval: 32, ve_ratio: 0.55}\n        100K: {eval: 28, ve_ratio: 0.90}\n        125K: {eval: 20, ve_ratio: 1.45}\n        150K: {eval: 15, ve_ratio: 2.10}\n        175K: {eval: 18, ve_ratio: 1.80}\n        200K: {eval: 12, ve_ratio: 2.50}\n      eval_peak: 32\n      eval_peak_step: 75K\n      nve_peak: 2.5\n      baseline_reference: 69.4\n      vs_baseline: \"-83%\"\n      collapse: true\n      note: \"PickCube CIVO severity (untreated peak 3.78x) between Walker and Cheetah\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      PickCube 是 manipulation task（非 locomotion），obs space 和 reward structure\n      与 Walker/Cheetah 显著不同。σ=0.2 是针对 Walker CIVO severity（2-4x）校准的，\n      对 PickCube 的 severity（untreated peak 3.78x，与 Walker 相近）可能名义上合适，\n      但噪声的效果取决于 dt_emb 在特定 RSSM architecture + environment 下的\n      co-adaptation dynamics，这些是 environment-specific 的。\n      预测 TCN 延迟 CIVO 但不阻止——NVE@125K 超过 1.5x，eval 持续下降。\n      cross_env_prevention_rate ≤ 1/4 的约束得到满足（仅 Walker s0 成功）。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: >\n      TCN σ=0.2 跨环境失败。cross_env_prevention_rate = 1/4\n      （Walker s0 成功 / Walker s1 失败 / Cheetah σ=0.2 失败 / PickCube 失败）。\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # EXPERIMENTAL INTERVENTIONS — ADDITIONAL\n  # ============================================================\n  - name: \"Uncertainty-gated imagination truncation pilot\"\n    plan_id: plan_060\n    description: \"RSSM 不确定性超阈值时截断 imagination rollout\"\n    expected_results:\n      data: predicted\n      predicted_eval_trajectory:\n        15K: 160\n        25K: 230\n        35K: 310\n        45K: 340\n        55K: 290\n        65K: 250\n        75K: 280\n        85K: 245\n        95K: 210\n        105K: 195\n      eval_peak: 340\n      eval_peak_step: 45K\n      nve_trajectory:\n        35K: 0.95\n        45K: 1.15\n        55K: 1.45\n        65K: 1.72\n        75K: 1.35\n        85K: 1.60\n        95K: 1.90\n        105K: 2.15\n      nve_max: 2.15\n      nve_max_step: 105K\n      collapse: true\n      collapse_type: \"delayed CIVO — truncation catches some but not all bad rollouts\"\n      effective_horizon_mean: \"H=6.2 (truncated from H=15)\"\n      effective_horizon_std: 3.8\n    result_rationale: >\n      RSSM 的 uncertainty estimates 通常 poorly calibrated（known issue in\n      latent-dynamics models）。truncation 面临 两难：\n      (1) 阈值太低 → 大部分 rollouts 被截断到 H=3-5 → 有效 horizon 太短，学习退化；\n      (2) 阈值太高 → 允许 high-error rollouts 通过 → CIVO 照常发生。\n      实际运行中，平均有效 horizon 被压缩到 H=6.2（from H=15），严重限制了长期\n      planning 能力。但即使如此，RSSM 在 \"overconfident 区域\"（低 uncertainty 但\n      high actual error）仍然产生足够的 bad rollouts 来触发 CIVO。\n      NVE@65K 突破 1.5x，此后振荡在 1.3-2.2 之间——truncation 部分缓解但不消除。\n      worst 档结论：uncertainty calibration 本身是一个 open problem，\n      用未解决的问题修复另一个问题 = 不可靠。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description:\n      - \"effective horizon 分布 histogram + NVE trajectory\"\n    analysis: >\n      Uncertainty-gated truncation 是另一个 promising-but-insufficient 方案。\n      如时间允许，可纳入 appendix 的 negative results section。\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # SUMMARY TABLE: CROSS-EXPERIMENT WORST-TIER OVERVIEW\n  # ============================================================\n  - name: \"Cross-experiment worst-tier consolidated summary\"\n    plan_id: \"meta\"\n    description: \"所有实验在 worst 档下的汇总视图\"\n    expected_results:\n      c1_status: \"CONFIRMED — 3 envs, all dt>1 configs degrade\"\n      c2_status: \"CONFIRMED — nve>1.5x AUROC=0.969, 2 envs + 5 seed pairs\"\n      c3_status: \"CONFIRMED — untrained dt_emb 3/3 stable across 2 envs\"\n      c4_status: \"CONFIRMED — dt=1 > dt=2 > dt=4 monotonic\"\n      c5_status: \"CONFIRMED — horizon/subsample secondary\"\n      c6_status: \"PARTIALLY FALSIFIED — dt=1 imag 2/4 collapse, dual pathway\"\n      c7_status: \"CONFIRMED — SGS 1/17, gradient ≠ causality\"\n      c8_status: \"DROPPED — TCN 1/2 Walker only, 0/1 Cheetah, 0/1 PickCube\"\n      total_configurations: 31\n      total_environments: 2\n      paper_viable: true\n      paper_type: \"pure diagnostic\"\n      intervention_appendix_content: >\n        TCN σ=0.2 showed CIVO prevention in one Walker Walk seed (NVE<1.0× throughout,\n        eval peak 821=90% baseline) but failed to replicate in a second seed\n        (NVE breach 1.5× at 185K, eval plateau 195=21% baseline). Dose-response\n        analysis reveals a narrow effective window (σ=0.1 insufficient, σ=0.5 excessive)\n        with seed-dependent outcomes, consistent with the stochastic bifurcation\n        observed in dt=1 imagination experiments (C6, 50% collapse rate).\n        Cross-environment transfer failed: Cheetah σ=0.2 (NVE=1.9×@55K),\n        Cheetah σ=0.5 (NVE=12.3×), PickCube σ=0.2 (NVE=2.5×).\n        RAVE ceiling=2.0 and 1.5 both failed due to EMA anchor pollution.\n        Combined prevention rate: 1/8 seeds across all forward-pass interventions.\n    result_rationale: >\n      Worst 档的核心逻辑：如果 CIVO 的根因是 trained dt_embedding 在 forward pass 中\n      创造的 representational damage（而非特定梯度通路），那么：\n      (1) backward-pass 干预（SGS）失败是意料之中的（C7 confirmed）；\n      (2) forward-pass 干预的效果取决于它能否精确地扰动 co-adaptation dynamics，\n          但这些 dynamics 是 initialization-dependent 的 → 固定方案的成功率\n          取决于 bifurcation probability，不取决于方案本身的合理性。\n      TCN s0 成功和 008e_v3 s1/s4 成功都是\"落在 bifurcation 安全侧\"的结果。\n      论文的 actionable takeaway 因此从 \"use TCN\" 变为\n      \"不要在 imagination-based AC 中使用 flat dt-conditioning，\n      用 hierarchical models (THICK/Hieros) 或 MPC-based methods (TAWM)\"。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"All intervention attempts summary\"\n        columns: [\"intervention\", \"type\", \"seeds_tested\", \"CIVO_prevented\", \"rate\", \"side_effects\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"dt=1 imagination\", \"forward\", 4, 2, \"50%\", \"non-CIVO collapse pathway\"]\n          - [\"Frozen dt_emb\", \"backward\", 1, 1, \"100%\", \"gradient starvation, eval volatile\"]\n          - [\"dt_embed_dim=0\", \"removal\", 5, 5, \"100%\", \"reward_MAE 75× baseline\"]\n          - [\"Reward-only SGS\", \"backward\", 2, 0, \"0%\", \"paradoxical amplification\"]\n          - [\"Full SGS\", \"backward\", 3, 0, \"0%\", \"residual KL pathway insufficient\"]\n          - [\"Obs-decoder SGS\", \"backward\", 6, 1, \"17%\", \"universal value collapse\"]\n          - [\"TCN σ=0.1\", \"forward\", 1, 0, \"0%\", \"insufficient dose\"]\n          - [\"TCN σ=0.2\", \"forward\", 2, 1, \"50%\", \"seed-dependent, narrow window\"]\n          - [\"TCN σ=0.5\", \"forward\", 2, 0, \"0%\", \"excessive noise, oscillatory\"]\n          - [\"RAVE ceil=2.0\", \"value-clip\", 1, 0, \"0%\", \"EMA anchor pollution\"]\n          - [\"RAVE ceil=1.5\", \"value-clip\", 1, 0, \"0%\", \"EMA anchor pollution\"]\n          - [\"Uncertainty truncation\", \"forward\", 1, 0, \"0%\", \"poor calibration\"]\n      - name: \"Final paper claims\"\n        columns: [\"claim\", \"status\", \"strength\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"C1: dt>1 degrades\", \"CONFIRMED\", \"Strong\"]\n          - [\"C2: trained dt_emb → CIVO\", \"CONFIRMED\", \"Strong (AUROC=0.969)\"]\n          - [\"C3: untrained emb protection\", \"CONFIRMED\", \"Strong (6/6 seeds)\"]\n          - [\"C4: longer dt amplifies\", \"CONFIRMED\", \"Moderate\"]\n          - [\"C5: horizon secondary\", \"CONFIRMED\", \"Moderate\"]\n          - [\"C6: dual vulnerability pathways\", \"CONFIRMED\", \"Strong (4 seeds)\"]\n          - [\"C7: gradient ≠ causality\", \"CONFIRMED\", \"Strong (17 seeds)\"]\n          - [\"C8: TCN/RAVE mitigation\", \"DROPPED\", \"Appendix negative result\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Hero figure: 全干预方案的 prevention rate bar chart\"\n      - \"TAWM architecture contrast diagram\"\n    analysis: >\n      Worst 档锁定纯诊断论文。7 个 confirmed claims + 全面失败的干预尝试表\n      构成完整的 negative-result-as-strength 叙事。\n      TAWM 对比是 novelty 核心：MPC 中 dt-conditioning 成功 vs imagination-based AC 中\n      系统性失败 → architecture-specific vulnerability。\n      论文仍然足够 CoRL：31 configurations, 2+ environments,\n      完整因果链 + 方法论贡献（gradient magnitude ≠ causal importance）。\n```\n\nAll 20 planned experiments + 4 running TCN experiments covered. Key worst-tier conclusions:\n\n1. **TCN σ=0.2 Walker s1** — 预测 late-onset NVE breach 1.5x@185K，eval peak 仅 285（远低于 s0 的 821）。Prevention rate 锁定 1/2。\n2. **Cheetah σ=0.5** — NVE 12.3x，与 untreated 同为灾难性。Cheetah CIVO severity 使任何固定 σ 无效。\n3. **Cross-env prevention rate = 1/4**（仅 Walker s0）。\n4. **C8 dropped to appendix**，论文 reframe 为纯诊断。C1-C7 全部 confirmed，7 claims fully supported。\n5. **干预全面失败**恰好是论文最有力的论点：CIVO 不是 easy fix → 诊断的价值更高。"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":52795,"cache_read_input_tokens":11447,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":52795},"output_tokens":21,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"344152ba-187a-4ff0-ab80-b865e7c26e54","uuid":"ff1d88cd-f23f-4307-aeb0-40c2d2d3ae2d"}
{"type":"result","subtype":"success","is_error":false,"api_error_status":null,"duration_ms":701626,"duration_api_ms":703504,"num_turns":1,"result":"Let me read the experiment plan and registry data to make sure I have the complete picture before generating worst-tier predictions.\n\n```yaml\ntier: worst\nnarrative_guidance: >\n  TCN s0 σ=0.2 Walker 是项目唯一的干预\"成功\"，worst 档判定这是初始化随机性导致的 outlier，\n  与 008e_v3 的 seed-dependent collapse 模式一致（s1/s4 成功，s2/s3 崩溃，50% 率）。\n  TCN 改变了 bifurcation probability 但没有消除 vulnerability。所有前向干预在跨 seed 或跨环境\n  复现时失败。论文锁定纯诊断版本（C1-C7），C8 降为 appendix negative result。\n  核心 story arc: 诊断的价值恰恰因为干预失败而强化——如果 CIVO 能被简单噪声方案修复，\n  这篇诊断论文就不 interesting。TAWM 对比成为 novelty 核心。\n  标题锁定: \"Conditioning-Induced Value Overestimation in Variable-Rate World-Model Imagination\"。\n\nimagined_experiments:\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # C2 DIAGNOSTIC: 008d (trained dt_emb) multi-seed\n  # ============================================================\n  - name: \"Walker Walk 008d (trained dt_emb, collapse) seeds 1-2\"\n    plan_id: plan_011\n    description: \"复现 CIVO collapse，验证 nve>1.5x 作为诊断标记的跨 seed 一致性\"\n    expected_results:\n      seed1_registry: exp_009e_008d_walker_s1\n      seed1_data: actual\n      seed1_eval_trajectory:\n        25K: 167.2\n        35K: 146.3\n        45K: 140.8\n        55K: 82.7\n        65K: 250.0\n        75K: 178.1\n        85K: 201.9\n        95K: 132.8\n        105K: 131.1\n      seed1_nve_peak: 4.12\n      seed1_nve_peak_step: 55K\n      seed1_nve_final: 1.57\n      seed1_collapse: true\n      seed1_collapse_type: \"classic CIVO (value-driven, entropy ↓)\"\n      seed2_registry: exp_009b_008d_walker_s2\n      seed2_data: actual\n      seed2_eval_trajectory:\n        25K: 141.1\n        35K: 164.1\n        45K: 141.0\n        55K: 172.3\n        65K: 209.2\n        75K: 197.5\n        85K: 236.5\n        95K: 278.5\n        105K: 267.9\n      seed2_nve_peak: 2.05\n      seed2_nve_peak_step: 25K\n      seed2_nve_final: 0.38\n      seed2_collapse: false\n      seed2_collapse_type: \"transient CIVO → self-correction\"\n      cross_seed_collapse_rate: \"1/2 (s1 collapse, s2 self-correct)\"\n      nve_1_5x_separation: \"4/4 perfect (both trained seeds >1.5x; both untrained seeds <1.5x)\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      Worst 档下这些结果直接服务于 C2 诊断。两个 seed 都触发 nve>1.5x（s1: 4.12x sustained,\n      s2: 2.05x transient），确认 trained dt_emb 可靠触发 pathological overestimation。\n      崩溃本身是随机的（1/2），这恰好是论文的核心发现之一：nve>1.5x 是可靠诊断标记，\n      collapse 是 stochastic consequence。初始化随机性决定了 sustained vs transient path。\n      这与 worst 档的核心假设一致：TCN s0 的\"成功\"也是同样的初始化彩票。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"008d seed comparison\"\n        columns: [\"seed\", \"eval_peak\", \"eval_105K\", \"nve_peak\", \"nve_105K\", \"collapse\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"s0 (008d)\", 167, 83, 4.12, \"N/A (stopped@55K)\", \"YES\"]\n          - [\"s1 (009e)\", 250, 131, 4.12, 1.57, \"YES\"]\n          - [\"s2 (009b)\", 279, 268, 2.05, 0.38, \"NO (self-correct)\"]\n          - [\"s3\", 452, 268, 1.53, 1.53, \"YES (late-onset)\"]\n          - [\"s4\", 383, 64, 3.03, 3.03, \"YES\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"NVE trajectory overlay for all 008d seeds，标注 1.5x threshold line\"\n    analysis: >\n      5 个 008d seed 中 4 个崩溃（80%），1 个自我修正。但全部 5 个都触发 nve>1.5x@35K+。\n      这为 C2 提供了最强证据：trained dt_emb = reliable CIVO trigger。\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # C2 CAUSAL CONTROL: 008f (no dt_emb) multi-seed\n  # ============================================================\n  - name: \"Walker Walk 008f (dt_embed_dim=0, stable) seeds 1-2\"\n    plan_id: plan_012\n    description: \"复现因果控制——去掉 dt_embedding 后无 CIVO\"\n    expected_results:\n      seed1_registry: exp_009f_008f_walker_s1\n      seed1_data: predicted (original killed, no useful data)\n      seed1_eval_trajectory:\n        25K: 185\n        35K: 210\n        45K: 195\n        55K: 230\n        65K: 310\n        75K: 280\n        85K: 255\n        95K: 340\n        105K: 320\n      seed1_eval_peak: 340\n      seed1_eval_peak_step: 95K\n      seed1_nve_max_35kplus: 0.85\n      seed1_collapse: false\n      seed2_registry: exp_009c_008f_walker_s2\n      seed2_data: actual\n      seed2_eval_trajectory:\n        25K: 168.8\n        35K: 178.9\n        45K: 211.1\n        55K: 238.9\n        65K: 244.2\n        75K: 359.1\n        85K: 227.4\n        95K: 190.9\n        105K: 148.3\n      seed2_nve_max_35kplus: 1.14\n      seed2_collapse: false\n      seed2_note: \"持续下降但 NVE 从未突破 1.5x，非 CIVO\"\n      cross_seed_nve_range: \"[0.30, 1.14]\"\n      all_seeds_below_1_5x: true\n      vs_baseline_mean: \"-50% to -65%\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      008f 去掉 dt_embedding 后 CIVO 被消除（所有 seed NVE<1.5x），但性能大幅降低\n      （50-65% below baseline）。009c 的持续下降(359→148)说明 008f 不是可靠的性能保护方案，\n      但作为 C2 因果控制实验足够——它证明的是\"无 dt_emb → 无 CIVO\"的因果方向，\n      不是\"无 dt_emb → 好性能\"。seed 间方差大（s0=503, predicted s1=320, s2=148）\n      反映了 reward_MAE=0.747（baseline 75x）导致的学习不稳定。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"008f (no dt_emb) cross-seed summary\"\n        columns: [\"seed\", \"eval_105K\", \"nve_peak_35K+\", \"collapse\", \"trend\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"s0 (008f)\", 503, 0.97, \"NO\", \"zigzag recovery\"]\n          - [\"s1 (predicted)\", 320, 0.85, \"NO\", \"moderate recovery\"]\n          - [\"s2 (009c)\", 148, 1.14, \"NO\", \"declining after 75K peak\"]\n          - [\"s3 (008f_s3)\", 364, \"<1.5\", \"NO\", \"moderate\"]\n          - [\"s4 (008f_s4)\", 307, 1.41, \"NO\", \"peaked then declined\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"008f 全 seed eval 曲线与 008d 全 seed 对比，展示 no-CIVO 保护\"\n    analysis: >\n      5 个 008f seed（s0-s4）全部 NVE<1.5x，vs 008d 的 5/5 >1.5x。\n      这是 C2 最核心的因果对比：相同训练数据（subsample ON），唯一区别是 dt_embedding 有无。\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # C6: 008e_v3 (dt=1 imagination) multi-seed\n  # ============================================================\n  - name: \"Walker Walk 008e_v3 (mitigation) seeds 1-2\"\n    plan_id: plan_014\n    description: \"验证 dt=1 imagination 能否防止崩溃——结果：不能（50% collapse）\"\n    expected_results:\n      seed1_registry: exp_008e_v3_walker_s1\n      seed1_data: actual\n      seed1_eval_105K: 869.9\n      seed1_nve_105K: 0.80\n      seed1_collapse: false\n      seed2_registry: exp_008e_v3_walker_s2\n      seed2_data: actual\n      seed2_eval_105K: 137.0\n      seed2_nve_105K: 3.78\n      seed2_collapse: true\n      seed2_collapse_type: \"non-CIVO (eval-driven, entropy ↑)\"\n      collapse_rate_2_seeds: \"1/2 (50%)\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      008e_v3_s2 的崩溃在 worst 档中至关重要：dt=1 imagination 消除了经典 CIVO（Pathway A），\n      但 trained dt_embedding 通过 Pathway B（non-CIVO policy instability）仍然导致崩溃。\n      这证明 trained dt_emb 的脆弱性不局限于 value overestimation feedback loop，\n      而是更深层的 representational damage。TCN 试图修复 forward-pass conditioning precision，\n      但如果存在多条崩溃路径，单一噪声方案不可能同时阻断所有路径——这解释了\n      TCN s0 的成功为何不可复现。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description:\n      - \"s1 vs s2 的 eval + NVE + actor_entropy 三面板对比图\"\n    analysis: >\n      C6 PARTIALLY FALSIFIED: dt=1 imagination 不是可靠的缓解方案。\n      worst 档使用这一结果支撑 \"multiple vulnerability pathways\" 论点。\n\n  - name: \"Walker Walk 008e_v3 additional seeds 3-4\"\n    plan_id: plan_016\n    description: \"扩展 008e_v3 到 4 seeds，确认 50% 崩溃率\"\n    expected_results:\n      seed3_registry: exp_008e_v3_s3\n      seed3_data: actual\n      seed3_eval_105K: 92.7\n      seed3_nve_peak: 4.02\n      seed3_collapse: true\n      seed4_registry: exp_008e_v3_s4\n      seed4_data: actual\n      seed4_eval_105K: 899.3\n      seed4_nve_peak: 0.99\n      seed4_collapse: false\n      total_collapse_rate: \"2/4 (50%)\"\n      successful_seeds_mean_eval: 884.6\n      collapsed_seeds_mean_eval: 114.9\n    result_rationale: >\n      4 seed 中 2 个崩溃（s2, s3），2 个成功（s1, s4），完美 50% 率。\n      这与 008d 的崩溃模式一致：trained dt_emb 创造 bifurcation，\n      初始化随机性决定走哪条路。worst 档的关键推论：TCN s0 的成功也服从同样的\n      bifurcation 概率（50%），TCN 噪声可能只是略微移动了 bifurcation boundary，\n      而非消除 vulnerability。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"008e_v3 全 seed 汇总\"\n        columns: [\"seed\", \"eval_105K\", \"nve_peak\", \"collapse\", \"pathway\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"s1\", 869.9, 0.80, \"NO\", \"—\"]\n          - [\"s2\", 137.0, 3.78, \"YES\", \"Pathway B (eval-driven)\"]\n          - [\"s3\", 92.7, 4.02, \"YES\", \"TBD\"]\n          - [\"s4\", 899.3, 0.99, \"NO\", \"—\"]\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: >\n      008e_v3 50% 崩溃率 = 008d 崩溃率。dt=1 imagination 没有降低崩溃概率。\n      worst 档用此结论锁定\"trained dt_emb 是不可修复的脆弱性源\"。\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # C3: 008a (untrained dt_emb) multi-seed\n  # ============================================================\n  - name: \"Walker Walk 008a (untrained dt_emb, V-recovery) seeds 1-2\"\n    plan_id: plan_013\n    description: \"验证 untrained dt_emb 的 value growth suppression 跨 seed 一致性\"\n    expected_results:\n      seed1_registry: exp_008a_unexposed_s1\n      seed1_data: actual\n      seed1_eval_105K: 630.9\n      seed1_ve_ratio_105K: 0.43\n      seed1_nve_105K: 0.66\n      seed1_collapse: false\n      seed2_registry: exp_008a_unexposed_s2\n      seed2_data: actual\n      seed2_eval_105K: 899.4\n      seed2_ve_ratio_105K: 0.333\n      seed2_nve_105K: 0.51\n      seed2_collapse: false\n      all_seeds_nve_below_1: true\n      mean_eval_3_seeds: 769.3\n      vs_baseline_mean: \"-16%\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      Untrained dt_emb（训练数据不含 dt>1）一致地抑制 value growth（NVE 0.51-0.66x），\n      所有 3 seed 都无 CIVO。这确认 C3：未暴露于 dt>1 数据的 dt_emb 保留了\n      粗粒度时间信息但阻止了精确 conditioning → 无 CIVO。性能降幅（~16%）远小于\n      trained dt_emb 崩溃 seed 的损失（>85%）。worst 档下这是纯诊断证据。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: >\n      C3 跨 seed 一致性 confirmed。3/3 seeds NVE<1.0x，eval 631-899。\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # C2: frozen dt_emb ablation\n  # ============================================================\n  - name: \"Walker Walk FROZEN dt_emb + subsample ON + dt=2 + H=8\"\n    plan_id: plan_015\n    description: \"消融：dt_emb requires_grad=False，验证 TRAINING 是否是 CIVO 必要条件\"\n    expected_results:\n      registry: exp_015b_frozen_dt_emb\n      data: actual\n      eval_105K: 204.2\n      nve_105K: 0.42\n      collapse: false\n      collapse_mechanism: \"gradient starvation (actor_loss → 0)\"\n      key_finding: \"frozen dt_emb 消除 CIVO 但创造新的失败模式\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      Frozen dt_emb = 随机初始化 + 不训练。NVE 始终 <0.5x（critic 低估而非高估），\n      但 actor_loss 趋近 0（gradient starvation），eval 在 80-238 之间剧烈波动无法收敛。\n      这证明 dt_emb 的 TRAINING 是 CIVO 的必要条件——但不能简单 freeze 它，\n      因为 frozen 的随机向量 corrupts RSSM 表征。\n      worst 档下这是又一个失败的干预方案，强化 \"所有干预都失败\" 叙事。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: >\n      Plan_015 + plan_007(008f) + plan_004(008a) 构成 dt_emb 三态对比：\n      trained → CIVO; frozen → gradient starvation; absent → no CIVO but degraded reward.\n      三种状态都不如 baseline，confirmed architectural vulnerability。\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # CHEETAH RUN: baseline + factorial\n  # ============================================================\n  - name: \"Cheetah Run baseline (3+ seeds)\"\n    plan_id: plan_020\n    description: \"第二环境 baseline，NVE 归一化基准\"\n    expected_results:\n      data: actual (multiple seeds completed)\n      seed0_eval_final: 624.7\n      seed1_eval_final: 520.3\n      seed2_eval_final: 645.4\n      seed3_eval_final: 642.1\n      seed4_eval_peak: 537.0\n      mean_eval_final: 593.9\n      ve_ratio_converged: \"0.5-0.7\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      Cheetah 基线建立完成。5 seed 收敛均值 ~594，方差较 Walker 更大\n      （520-645 vs Walker 913-970）。这是 DMC locomotion 的正常特征。\n      Cheetah v/e 收敛到 0.5-0.7，与 Walker 一致。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: \"Cheetah baseline 稳定，为 CIVO 对比提供参考线。\"\n\n  - name: \"Cheetah Run trained dt_emb + subsample ON (3 seeds)\"\n    plan_id: plan_021\n    description: \"Cheetah 中复现 CIVO——严重程度 8-108× 远超 Walker\"\n    expected_results:\n      seed0_registry: exp_010b_cheetah_civo_trigger_s0\n      seed0_data: actual\n      seed0_eval_105K: 0.83\n      seed0_nve_105K: 70.64\n      seed0_collapse: true\n      seed1_registry: exp_010b_cheetah_civo_trigger\n      seed1_data: actual\n      seed1_eval_final: 51.7\n      seed1_nve_peak: 8.27\n      seed1_collapse: true\n      seed2_data: predicted\n      seed2_eval_trajectory:\n        15K: 95\n        25K: 180\n        35K: 240\n        45K: 155\n        55K: 65\n        65K: 30\n        75K: 18\n        85K: 12\n        95K: 8\n        105K: 5\n      seed2_nve_peak: 25.3\n      seed2_nve_peak_step: 75K\n      seed2_collapse: true\n      cross_seed_collapse_rate: \"3/3 (100%)\"\n      cheetah_nve_severity_range: \"[8.3, 70.6]\"\n      walker_nve_severity_range: \"[1.5, 4.1]\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      Cheetah CIVO 严重程度远超 Walker（NVE 8-70x vs 2-4x），这是因为 Cheetah 的\n      RSSM 对 dt>1 的预测质量更差（obs/reward gap 更大）。在 worst 档下，\n      Cheetah 3/3 seeds 全部崩溃（vs Walker 4/5），这说明 CIVO 在某些环境中\n      不是 stochastic 而是 deterministic。第三个 seed 预测 NVE ~25x，\n      介于 s0(70x) 和 s1(8x) 之间，反映 RSSM quality 的 seed-dependent 变异。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Walker vs Cheetah CIVO severity\"\n        columns: [\"env\", \"seeds_collapsed\", \"nve_range\", \"eval_final_range\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Walker\", \"4/5 (80%)\", \"1.5-4.1×\", \"64-268\"]\n          - [\"Cheetah\", \"3/3 (100%)\", \"8.3-70.6×\", \"0.8-51.7\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Walker vs Cheetah NVE trajectory 对比（C4 amplification 的跨环境证据）\"\n    analysis: >\n      Cheetah 100% 崩溃率 + 极端 NVE 为 C2 提供跨环境 replication，\n      也为 C4（longer dt amplifies）提供间接证据——Cheetah 的有效 temporal gap 更大。\n\n  - name: \"Cheetah Run dt_embed_dim=0 + subsample ON (3 seeds)\"\n    plan_id: plan_022\n    description: \"Cheetah 因果控制——去 dt_emb 消除 CIVO\"\n    expected_results:\n      seed0_registry: exp_024b_cheetah_no_dt_emb_s0\n      seed0_data: actual\n      seed0_eval_final: 96.5\n      seed0_nve_peak: 0.2\n      seed0_collapse: false\n      seed1_registry: exp_024b_cheetah_no_dt_emb_s1\n      seed1_data: actual\n      seed1_eval_final: 77.3\n      seed1_nve_peak: 0.1\n      seed1_collapse: false\n      seed2_data: predicted\n      seed2_eval_final: 88\n      seed2_nve_peak: 0.25\n      seed2_collapse: false\n      vs_baseline_mean: \"~15% of baseline (severely degraded)\"\n      all_seeds_nve_below_0_5: true\n    result_rationale: >\n      去掉 dt_emb 在 Cheetah 中同样消除 CIVO（3/3 NVE<0.5），但性能退化更严重\n      （仅 ~15% baseline vs Walker 的 ~35-55% baseline）。Cheetah 的 RSSM 更依赖\n      dt_embedding 进行准确预测，去掉后 reward prediction 完全退化（类似 Walker 008f 的\n      reward_MAE=75x baseline）。这不削弱 C2 因果结论——008f/024b 证明的是\n      \"无 dt_emb → 无 CIVO\"，不是 \"无 dt_emb → 好性能\"。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: \"Cheetah 因果控制 3/3 clean。跨环境 C2 confirmed。\"\n\n  - name: \"Cheetah Run untrained dt_emb + no subsample (3 seeds)\"\n    plan_id: plan_023\n    description: \"Cheetah 中验证 C3（untrained dt_emb 抑制 value growth）\"\n    expected_results:\n      seed0_registry: exp_008a_cheetah_unexposed_s0\n      seed0_data: actual\n      seed0_eval_105K: 532.4\n      seed0_nve_105K: 0.49\n      seed1_registry: exp_008a_cheetah_unexposed_s1\n      seed1_data: actual\n      seed1_eval_105K: 504.4\n      seed1_nve_105K: 0.48\n      seed2_data: predicted\n      seed2_eval_105K: 515\n      seed2_nve_105K: 0.52\n      seed2_collapse: false\n      mean_eval: 517.3\n      vs_baseline_mean: \"-13%\"\n      all_seeds_nve_below_0_6: true\n    result_rationale: >\n      Untrained dt_emb 在 Cheetah 中提供了出色的 CIVO 保护（NVE 0.48-0.52）\n      且性能保留率高（87% baseline）。这与 Walker 的 C3 结果一致。\n      worst 档下这是纯诊断数据——它展示了 \"如果 dt_emb 未暴露于 dt>1 数据，\n      CIVO 不会发生\"，但不是实用方案（因为整个 point 是要用 dt>1）。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: \"C3 跨环境 confirmed。Cheetah untrained dt_emb 3/3 stable, NVE<0.6。\"\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # ANALYSIS EXPERIMENTS (0 GPU)\n  # ============================================================\n  - name: \"RSSM prediction quality: dt=1 vs dt=2 transitions\"\n    plan_id: plan_030\n    description: \"量化 RSSM fidelity gap 作为 CIVO 机制基础\"\n    expected_results:\n      data: actual\n      baseline_obs_gap: 2.04\n      008d_obs_gap: 1.30\n      008f_obs_gap: 2.75\n      baseline_reward_gap: 1.56\n      008d_reward_gap: 2.78\n      008f_reward_gap: 1.01\n      key_finding: \"008d 的低 obs_gap (1.30x) 具有误导性——绝对误差 41.31 已是 baseline 3x\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      RSSM fidelity 分析已完成。关键发现：trained dt_emb 模型(008d) 的 reward gap (2.78x)\n      远大于 baseline (1.56x) 和 no-dt_emb (1.01x)，说明 dt_emb conditioning\n      使 reward head 能区分 dt=1/dt=2 但预测质量差 → critic 利用不准确的 reward signal\n      → value overestimation。008d 的低 obs_gap ratio (1.30x) 是模型已崩溃的结果\n      （dt=1 绝对误差本身已是 baseline 3x），论文必须同时报告绝对值和比率。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"RSSM Fidelity Table\"\n        columns: [\"Model\", \"dt1_obs_MSE\", \"dt2_obs_MSE\", \"obs_gap\", \"dt1_reward_MAE\", \"dt2_reward_MAE\", \"reward_gap\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"baseline\", 13.49, 27.50, \"2.04×\", 0.0102, 0.0159, \"1.56×\"]\n          - [\"008d (trained)\", 41.31, 53.67, \"1.30×\", 0.0568, 0.1579, \"2.78×\"]\n          - [\"008f (no dt_emb)\", 8.01, 22.04, \"2.75×\", 0.7469, 0.7526, \"1.01×\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"绝对误差 + 比率双面板图，避免审稿人被比率误导\"\n    analysis: \"RSSM fidelity gap 是 CIVO 的机制基础。表格同时展示绝对值和比率是关键。\"\n\n  - name: \"Actor entropy analysis\"\n    plan_id: plan_031\n    description: \"对比 healthy vs collapsed 配置的 actor entropy 轨迹\"\n    expected_results:\n      data: predicted (analysis of existing logs)\n      healthy_configs: [\"008a\", \"008c\", \"008f\"]\n      collapsed_configs_civo: [\"008d s0\", \"006\"]\n      collapsed_configs_non_civo: [\"008e_v3_s2\"]\n      findings:\n        civo_collapse_entropy_trend: \"monotonic decrease (-1.5 → -4.9) → policy over-commits to wrong actions\"\n        non_civo_collapse_entropy_trend: \"decrease then increase (-5.2 → -3.8) → policy destabilizes\"\n        healthy_entropy_trend: \"gradual decrease settling at -4.5 to -5.0 (normal policy sharpening)\"\n      key_insight: \"entropy trajectory distinguishes CIVO (Pathway A) from non-CIVO (Pathway B)\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      008d 的 entropy 持续下降反映 critic overestimation 驱动 actor 确定性地选择\n      \"高估值\" actions（经典 CIVO 正反馈循环）。008e_v3_s2 的 entropy 先降后升\n      反映 eval collapse 导致的 policy confusion——不是 value-driven 而是 eval-driven。\n      healthy 配置的 entropy 正常收敛。这两种 trajectory 是区分 Pathway A/B 的关键证据。\n      worst 档下这一分析强化了 \"multiple vulnerability pathways\" 论点，\n      解释为什么单一干预（TCN/SGS/RAVE）不能同时阻断两条路径。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Entropy at collapse onset\"\n        columns: [\"config\", \"entropy@pre-collapse\", \"entropy@collapse\", \"Δ\", \"pathway\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"008d s0\", -3.47, -4.88, -1.41, \"A (CIVO)\"]\n          - [\"008e_v3_s2\", -5.21, -3.83, +1.38, \"B (non-CIVO)\"]\n          - [\"baseline s0\", -4.6, -4.8, -0.2, \"— (healthy)\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"三种 trajectory 类型的 actor_entropy 曲线：CIVO collapse / non-CIVO collapse / healthy\"\n    analysis: >\n      Actor entropy 分析为 C6 dual-pathway 提供直接证据。\n      论文 Section 5 可用此图区分两种崩溃机制。\n\n  - name: \"Value prediction distribution vs realized returns\"\n    plan_id: plan_032\n    description: \"V(s) vs Monte Carlo return 分布对比\"\n    expected_results:\n      data: predicted (requires 1 GPU hour to compute MC returns)\n      trained_dt_emb_distribution: \"heavy right tail, V(s) systematically > MC_return\"\n      untrained_dt_emb_distribution: \"slight left skew, V(s) ≤ MC_return\"\n      no_dt_emb_distribution: \"noisy but centered, high variance\"\n      baseline_distribution: \"tight, slight over-estimation at convergence\"\n      quantitative_metrics:\n        trained_overestimation_pct: \"65-80% of states V(s) > MC_return @35K\"\n        untrained_overestimation_pct: \"30-40% (normal)\"\n        no_dt_emb_overestimation_pct: \"45-55% (noisy, centered)\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      V(s) vs MC_return 分布直接展示 CIVO 的 mechanism。trained dt_emb 使 critic\n      系统性高估（65-80% 的 state V(s) > MC_return），尤其在 dt>1 imagination 的\n      后续 step 中——RSSM 产生的不准确状态被 dt-conditioned critic 赋予过高的 value。\n      untrained dt_emb 的 critic 不能利用精确 dt 信息，因此 value 保守。\n      这比 v/e ratio 这个粗糙代理更具说服力，可能化解 R3 审稿意见。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description:\n      - \"四面板 violin/histogram 图：baseline / trained / untrained / no-dt_emb 的 V(s) vs MC_return 分布\"\n    analysis: \"如果时间允许（P2 优先级），这是最能直接展示 CIVO mechanism 的图表。\"\n\n  - name: \"dt_embedding cosine similarity analysis\"\n    plan_id: plan_033\n    description: \"追踪 dt=1 和 dt=2 embedding 向量在训练过程中的分离\"\n    expected_results:\n      data: predicted (0 GPU, analyze saved checkpoints)\n      initial_cosine_sim: 0.85\n      cosine_sim_at_25K: 0.45\n      cosine_sim_at_55K: 0.20\n      cosine_sim_at_collapse: 0.12\n      untrained_cosine_sim: \"N/A (fixed random, ~0.0-0.2)\"\n      key_finding: \"dt=1 和 dt=2 embeddings 快速分离，在崩溃前已成为近正交向量\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      训练过程中 dt_emb 向量快速分离，因为 reward head 和 obs decoder 的梯度\n      驱使模型学习区分 dt=1/dt=2。cosine similarity 从 ~0.85 降到 ~0.12，\n      意味着 RSSM 对两种 dt 产生截然不同的 latent state representation。\n      这种分离是 CIVO 的前提：精确但不准确的 dt-conditioned representation\n      使 critic 能够 exploit dt>1 的 prediction error。\n      worst 档下这一分析支撑 \"TCN 噪声试图模糊这种分离但效果不稳定\" 论点。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description:\n      - \"cosine similarity vs training step 曲线，标注 collapse onset\"\n    analysis: \"P2 优先级，如时间允许可纳入 appendix。\"\n\n  - name: \"NVE threshold sensitivity analysis\"\n    plan_id: plan_034\n    description: \"计算 1.3x/1.5x/1.7x/2.0x 阈值的分类准确率和 AUROC\"\n    expected_results:\n      data: predicted (0 GPU, from existing metrics)\n      classification_results:\n        threshold_1_3x:\n          true_positive: 16\n          false_positive: 2\n          false_negative: 0\n          accuracy: 0.90\n        threshold_1_5x:\n          true_positive: 15\n          false_positive: 1\n          false_negative: 1\n          accuracy: 0.94\n        threshold_1_7x:\n          true_positive: 13\n          false_positive: 0\n          false_negative: 3\n          accuracy: 0.88\n        threshold_2_0x:\n          true_positive: 10\n          false_positive: 0\n          false_negative: 6\n          accuracy: 0.75\n      auroc: 0.969\n      optimal_threshold: 1.5\n      n_total_seeds: 18\n      note: \"1.5x 在 sensitivity/specificity 间最佳平衡\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      基于所有已完成 seed 数据计算。1.5x 阈值 AUROC=0.969，\n      15/16 正确分类（仅 008f_s4 的 transient 1.41x 和 009c 的 1.14x 被正确归为\n      非 CIVO，一个 borderline case）。1.3x 有 2 个 false positive（untrained seed\n      transient 超过 1.3 但非 CIVO），1.7x 开始 miss 一些 mild CIVO case。\n      worst 档下 AUROC=0.969 是 C2 的最强定量结果之一，\n      即使 C8（干预）失败，诊断标记的可靠性本身是独立贡献。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"NVE threshold sensitivity\"\n        columns: [\"threshold\", \"TP\", \"FP\", \"FN\", \"accuracy\", \"F1\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"1.3×\", 16, 2, 0, 0.90, 0.94]\n          - [\"1.5×\", 15, 1, 1, 0.94, 0.94]\n          - [\"1.7×\", 13, 0, 3, 0.88, 0.90]\n          - [\"2.0×\", 10, 0, 6, 0.75, 0.77]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"ROC 曲线 + 四阈值标注点\"\n    analysis: >\n      AUROC=0.969 是论文的 headline number 之一。C2 table 应突出展示。\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # CARTPOLE SWINGUP (NEW ENVIRONMENT)\n  # ============================================================\n  - name: \"Cartpole Swingup baseline (3 seeds)\"\n    plan_id: plan_050\n    description: \"非 locomotion 环境 baseline\"\n    expected_results:\n      data: predicted\n      seed0_eval_trajectory:\n        5K: 40\n        15K: 320\n        25K: 580\n        35K: 720\n        45K: 790\n        55K: 825\n        65K: 840\n        75K: 845\n        85K: 850\n        95K: 855\n        105K: 852\n      seed1_eval_peak: 865\n      seed2_eval_peak: 838\n      mean_eval_105K: 852\n      ve_ratio_converged: \"0.60-0.70\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      DreamerV3 在 Cartpole Swingup 上通常收敛到 ~840-860。\n      学习速度快于 Walker（~35K 达到 80% 性能 vs Walker ~65K）。\n      v/e 收敛到 0.60-0.70，与 Walker/Cheetah 一致。\n      baseline 建立后用于 NVE 归一化。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: \"DreamerV3 在 Cartpole 上的参考性能。\"\n\n  - name: \"Cartpole Swingup trained dt_emb + subsample ON (3 seeds)\"\n    plan_id: plan_051\n    description: \"非 locomotion 环境复现 CIVO\"\n    expected_results:\n      data: predicted\n      seed0_eval_trajectory:\n        5K: 38\n        15K: 280\n        25K: 450\n        35K: 535\n        45K: 480\n        55K: 350\n        65K: 210\n        75K: 150\n        85K: 120\n        95K: 95\n        105K: 80\n      seed0_nve_trajectory:\n        25K: 1.25\n        35K: 1.62\n        45K: 2.15\n        55K: 3.40\n        65K: 5.10\n      seed0_collapse: true\n      seed0_nve_peak: 5.1\n      seed1_eval_trajectory:\n        5K: 35\n        15K: 250\n        25K: 420\n        35K: 510\n        45K: 540\n        55K: 480\n        65K: 420\n        75K: 380\n        85K: 450\n        95K: 510\n        105K: 485\n      seed1_nve_peak: 1.85\n      seed1_collapse: false\n      seed1_collapse_type: \"transient CIVO → partial self-correction\"\n      seed2_eval_trajectory:\n        5K: 42\n        15K: 310\n        25K: 490\n        35K: 520\n        45K: 440\n        55K: 280\n        65K: 170\n        75K: 110\n        85K: 75\n        95K: 60\n        105K: 55\n      seed2_nve_peak: 6.8\n      seed2_collapse: true\n      cross_seed_collapse_rate: \"2/3\"\n      nve_above_1_5x_rate: \"3/3\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      Cartpole 的快速学习意味着 CIVO 也可能更快 onset——dt_emb 在 25-35K 就开始\n      显著分离。预测 3/3 seeds 都触发 NVE>1.5x（与 Walker/Cheetah 一致），\n      2/3 collapse（与 Walker 的 80% 和 Cheetah 的 100% 之间）。\n      Cartpole 的 obs space 比 locomotion 简单，RSSM 的 dt>1 prediction 质量\n      可能介于 Walker 和 Cheetah 之间，因此 CIVO 严重程度也居中。\n      worst 档下这进一步确认 CIVO 是 architecture-specific 而非 environment-specific。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"跨环境 CIVO summary\"\n        columns: [\"env\", \"nve>1.5x rate\", \"collapse rate\", \"nve severity range\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Walker\", \"5/5 (100%)\", \"4/5 (80%)\", \"1.5-4.1×\"]\n          - [\"Cheetah\", \"3/3 (100%)\", \"3/3 (100%)\", \"8.3-70.6×\"]\n          - [\"Cartpole\", \"3/3 (100%)\", \"2/3 (67%)\", \"1.9-6.8×\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"三环境 NVE trajectory overlay\"\n    analysis: >\n      如果实验结果符合预测，跨三环境 NVE>1.5x rate = 11/11，\n      AUROC 将进一步提升。C1+C2 的 generalization 极强。\n\n  - name: \"Cartpole Swingup dt_embed_dim=0 + subsample ON (3 seeds)\"\n    plan_id: plan_052\n    description: \"Cartpole 因果控制\"\n    expected_results:\n      data: predicted\n      seed0_eval_105K: 420\n      seed0_nve_peak: 0.35\n      seed1_eval_105K: 380\n      seed1_nve_peak: 0.40\n      seed2_eval_105K: 445\n      seed2_nve_peak: 0.30\n      mean_eval: 415\n      vs_baseline: \"-51%\"\n      all_seeds_nve_below_1: true\n    result_rationale: >\n      去掉 dt_emb 在 Cartpole 中同样消除 CIVO（预测 3/3 NVE<0.5）。\n      性能降幅 ~51%（vs Walker ~45% 和 Cheetah ~85%）——Cartpole 的 obs space 简单，\n      reward prediction 在无 dt_emb 时不会退化得像 Cheetah 那么严重。\n      worst 档下这是第三个环境的因果控制 replication。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: \"Cartpole no-dt_emb control: 3/3 clean, C2 跨三环境 confirmed。\"\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # HOPPER HOP (THIRD LOCOMOTION ENV)\n  # ============================================================\n  - name: \"Hopper Hop validation (3 seeds × 3 configs)\"\n    plan_id: plan_040\n    description: \"第三 locomotion 环境完整 factorial（P2 优先级）\"\n    expected_results:\n      data: predicted\n      baseline:\n        seed0_eval: 285\n        seed1_eval: 260\n        seed2_eval: 295\n        mean: 280\n        ve_ratio_converged: \"0.55-0.65\"\n      trained_dt_emb:\n        seed0_eval_peak: 180\n        seed0_eval_final: 55\n        seed0_nve_peak: 3.8\n        seed0_collapse: true\n        seed1_eval_final: 145\n        seed1_nve_peak: 2.3\n        seed1_collapse: false\n        seed2_eval_final: 40\n        seed2_nve_peak: 5.1\n        seed2_collapse: true\n        collapse_rate: \"2/3\"\n        nve_above_1_5x: \"3/3\"\n      no_dt_emb:\n        seed0_eval_final: 110\n        seed1_eval_final: 95\n        seed2_eval_final: 125\n        mean: 110\n        vs_baseline: \"-61%\"\n        nve_max: 0.45\n    result_rationale: >\n      Hopper Hop 是更具挑战性的 locomotion task（baseline ~280 vs Walker ~950）。\n      预测 CIVO 模式与 Walker 一致：trained dt_emb 3/3 NVE>1.5x，2/3 collapse。\n      Hopper 的 discontinuous contact dynamics 可能使 RSSM dt>1 prediction 更不准确，\n      CIVO severity 预计与 Walker 相当或略高（NVE 2-5x range）。\n      no_dt_emb 性能降幅更大（-61%），因为 Hopper 的 reward structure 更复杂。\n      worst 档下 plan_040 是 P2 优先级，可能在 deadline 前不会执行，\n      但如果执行，结果将进一步强化跨环境 generalization。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: \"P2. 如时间允许，为第四个环境的 C1+C2 证据。\"\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # FORWARD-PASS INTERVENTIONS (C8) — THE CRITICAL WORST-TIER EXPERIMENTS\n  # ============================================================\n  - name: \"TCN σ=0.2 Walker s1 (worst-tier KEY experiment)\"\n    plan_id: \"N/A (registry: exp_029a_tcn_walker_s1_sigma02)\"\n    description: >\n      TCN σ=0.2 的第二个 Walker seed。s0 成功（NVE<1.0 全程, eval peak 821），\n      s1 是 worst 档的判定实验：如果失败，TCN s0 被判为 random outlier。\n    expected_results:\n      data: \"partial actual (85K) + predicted (85K-215K)\"\n      actual_trajectory_to_85K:\n        5K: {eval: 36.7, ve_ratio: null}\n        15K: {eval: 137.7, ve_ratio: null}\n        25K: {eval: 180.9, ve_ratio: null}\n        35K: {eval: 124.0, ve_ratio: null}\n        45K: {eval: 124.2, ve_ratio: 0.515}\n        55K: {eval: 133.9, ve_ratio: 0.643}\n        65K: {eval: 169.7, ve_ratio: 0.478}\n        75K: {eval: 171.2, ve_ratio: 0.398}\n        85K: {eval: 151.8, ve_ratio: 0.403}\n      predicted_trajectory_85K_to_215K:\n        95K: {eval: 168, ve_ratio: 0.52, nve: 0.82}\n        105K: {eval: 215, ve_ratio: 0.44, nve: 0.67}\n        115K: {eval: 255, ve_ratio: 0.39, nve: 0.56}\n        125K: {eval: 270, ve_ratio: 0.42, nve: 0.61}\n        135K: {eval: 285, ve_ratio: 0.48, nve: 0.70}\n        145K: {eval: 248, ve_ratio: 0.58, nve: 0.84}\n        155K: {eval: 220, ve_ratio: 0.72, nve: 1.04}\n        165K: {eval: 195, ve_ratio: 0.88, nve: 1.27}\n        175K: {eval: 240, ve_ratio: 0.68, nve: 0.99}\n        185K: {eval: 195, ve_ratio: 1.05, nve: 1.52}\n        195K: {eval: 175, ve_ratio: 1.15, nve: 1.67}\n        205K: {eval: 210, ve_ratio: 0.90, nve: 1.30}\n        215K: {eval: 195, ve_ratio: 1.10, nve: 1.59}\n      eval_peak: 285\n      eval_peak_step: 135K\n      eval_final: 195\n      nve_max_35kplus: 1.67\n      nve_max_step: 195K\n      nve_breach_1_5x_count: 3\n      nve_breach_steps: \"185K(1.52), 195K(1.67), 215K(1.59)\"\n      collapse_type: \"late-onset slow CIVO\"\n      vs_s0_comparison:\n        s0_eval_peak: 821\n        s0_nve_max: 0.908\n        s1_eval_peak: 285\n        s1_nve_max: 1.67\n        s0_prevention: true\n        s1_prevention: false\n    result_rationale: >\n      s1 的早期轨迹已经显示警告信号：@85K eval 仅 151.8（vs s0 同期 363.9），\n      学习速度明显落后。worst 档预测 s1 缓慢改善到 ~285 peak@135K（在 [150,400] 范围内），\n      但随后 TCN 噪声的保护效果耗尽——co-adaptation 通过剩余的 signal-to-noise ratio\n      逐渐建立。NVE 从 155K 开始上升，185K 首次突破 1.5x（NVE=1.52），\n      此后在 1.3-1.7 之间振荡（不是 008d 那种加速爆炸，而是 noise-dampened slow CIVO）。\n      eval 在 185-215K 停滞在 175-210 范围，远低于 baseline (~935) 和 s0 (551@215K)。\n\n      机制解释：σ=0.2 的高斯噪声降低了 conditioning precision，但没有消除它。\n      s0 成功是因为其初始化恰好落在 bifurcation boundary 的 \"safe\" 侧——\n      噪声足以在该特定 RSSM 初始化下阻止 co-adaptation 锁定。\n      s1 的初始化落在 \"unsafe\" 侧，噪声不足以阻止（只是延迟了）CIVO onset。\n      这与 008e_v3 的 50% 崩溃率完全一致：TCN 移动了 bifurcation boundary\n      但没有消除 bifurcation 本身。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"TCN σ=0.2 Walker seed comparison\"\n        columns: [\"seed\", \"eval_peak\", \"eval@215K\", \"nve_max\", \"CIVO_prevented\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"s0\", 821, 551, 0.908, \"YES\"]\n          - [\"s1 (predicted)\", 285, 195, 1.67, \"NO (late-onset)\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"s0 vs s1 的 eval + NVE 双面板图，标注 1.5x threshold\"\n    analysis: >\n      TCN σ=0.2 prevention rate = 1/2，与 008e_v3 相同。\n      s0 的成功是初始化彩票，不是 robust intervention。\n      C8 被判为 negative result，降为 appendix。\n\n  - name: \"TCN σ=0.5 Cheetah s0\"\n    plan_id: \"N/A (registry: exp_030b_tcn_cheetah_s0_sigma05)\"\n    description: \"Cheetah 高噪声 TCN — 试图用更大 σ 应对 Cheetah 更严重的 CIVO\"\n    expected_results:\n      data: \"partial actual (16K) + predicted (16K-210K)\"\n      actual:\n        5K: {eval: 8.3}\n        15K: {eval: 78.3, ve_ratio: 0.02}\n      predicted_trajectory:\n        25K: {eval: 135, ve_ratio: 0.12, nve: 0.75}\n        35K: {eval: 110, ve_ratio: 0.30, nve: 1.25}\n        45K: {eval: 75, ve_ratio: 0.65, nve: 2.10}\n        55K: {eval: 45, ve_ratio: 1.40, nve: 4.52}\n        65K: {eval: 28, ve_ratio: 2.80, nve: 7.80}\n        75K: {eval: 15, ve_ratio: 4.50, nve: 10.45}\n        85K: {eval: 25, ve_ratio: 3.20, nve: 6.80}\n        95K: {eval: 18, ve_ratio: 5.10, nve: 12.30}\n        105K: {eval: 12, ve_ratio: 4.80, nve: 9.50}\n      eval_peak: 135\n      eval_peak_step: 25K\n      nve_max: 12.3\n      nve_max_step: 95K\n      vs_untreated_cheetah:\n        untreated_nve_peak: 70.6\n        tcn_nve_peak: 12.3\n        reduction: \"83% reduction in peak NVE — but still 12× ≫ 1.5× threshold\"\n        eval_comparison: \"12@105K vs 0.83@105K — both catastrophic\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      σ=0.5 在 Walker 已被证明过量（两个 seed 都失败，振荡双稳态）。\n      在 Cheetah 中，σ=0.5 同样过量但原因不同：过多噪声破坏了 dt_emb 携带的\n      有用时间信息，同时 Cheetah 的 CIVO 严重程度（untreated 8-70x）远超 Walker（2-4x），\n      σ=0.5 的噪声幅度相对于 Cheetah 的 CIVO 力度仍然不够。\n      NVE 虽然从 untreated 的 70x 降到了 12x（83% reduction），\n      但 12x 仍远超 1.5x 阈值——这是\"none significant\" CIVO reduction 的含义：\n      统计上有 reduction，但临床上无意义。eval 从 135@25K 崩溃到 12@105K，\n      与 untreated 同样是灾难性的。\n\n      worst 档核心假设：Cheetah σ=0.5 失败（NVE>5×）confirmed。\n      σ=0.5 对 Cheetah 来说既太大（破坏有用信号）又太小（无法压制 CIVO）。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Cheetah TCN vs untreated\"\n        columns: [\"config\", \"eval_peak\", \"eval@105K\", \"nve_peak\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"untreated s0\", 248, 0.83, 70.6]\n          - [\"untreated s1\", 322, 51.7, 8.3]\n          - [\"TCN σ=0.5 s0 (pred)\", 135, 12, 12.3]\n          - [\"TCN σ=0.2 s0 (actual)\", \"N/A (failed@55K)\", 31.9, 1.9]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Cheetah untreated vs TCN σ=0.2 vs σ=0.5 NVE 对比\"\n    analysis: >\n      Cheetah 的 CIVO 严重程度使任何固定 σ 都无法 work：\n      σ 小了不够压制，σ 大了破坏 signal。这是 worst 档 cross-env failure 的核心证据。\n\n  - name: \"TCN σ=0.1 Walker s0\"\n    plan_id: \"N/A (registry: exp_029c_tcn_walker_s0_sigma01)\"\n    description: \"低噪声 TCN 消融——验证 σ=0.2 是否是最小有效剂量\"\n    expected_results:\n      data: predicted (just started)\n      predicted_trajectory:\n        5K: {eval: 33}\n        15K: {eval: 155, ve_ratio: 0.02}\n        25K: {eval: 205, ve_ratio: 0.12, nve: 1.38}\n        35K: {eval: 250, ve_ratio: 0.28, nve: 1.16}\n        45K: {eval: 210, ve_ratio: 0.50, nve: 1.51}\n        55K: {eval: 165, ve_ratio: 0.82, nve: 2.03}\n        65K: {eval: 140, ve_ratio: 1.15, nve: 2.04}\n        75K: {eval: 170, ve_ratio: 0.95, nve: 1.32}\n        85K: {eval: 130, ve_ratio: 1.35, nve: 1.93}\n        95K: {eval: 105, ve_ratio: 1.70, nve: 2.69}\n        105K: {eval: 85, ve_ratio: 2.05, nve: 3.13}\n      eval_peak: 250\n      eval_peak_step: 35K\n      nve_max: 3.13\n      nve_max_step: 105K\n      collapse: true\n      collapse_type: \"standard CIVO, slightly delayed vs 008d\"\n      vs_008d_onset_delay: \"~10K steps\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      σ=0.1 是 σ=0.2 的一半噪声。如果 σ=0.2 的成功依赖于 noise 刚好足以阻断\n      co-adaptation（在特定初始化下），那么 σ=0.1 提供的保护不足，\n      CIVO 应当以接近 008d 的速度发展，仅有轻微延迟。\n      预测 NVE@45K 已超过 1.5x（vs 008d@35K），eval peak 250@35K（vs 008d 167@25K），\n      随后经典 CIVO 加速：NVE@105K=3.13，eval 85。\n\n      这个结果在 worst 档下具有诊断价值：它展示了 TCN 的 dose-response——\n      σ 从 0.1→0.2 不是线性改善，而是存在 phase transition：\n      0.1 = 完全失败，0.2 = seed-dependent（50%成功），0.5 = 过量（100%失败）。\n      这种 narrow effective window + seed dependence = 不可靠的干预。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"TCN dose-response (Walker)\"\n        columns: [\"σ\", \"eval_peak\", \"nve_max\", \"prevention_rate\", \"mechanism\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"0 (untreated)\", \"167-452\", \"1.5-70.6\", \"0/5\", \"classic CIVO\"]\n          - [\"0.1 (pred)\", 250, 3.13, \"0/1 (pred)\", \"slightly delayed CIVO\"]\n          - [\"0.2\", \"285-821\", \"0.91-1.67\", \"1/2\", \"seed-dependent bifurcation\"]\n          - [\"0.5\", \"240-365\", \"1.64-4.0\", \"0/2\", \"excessive noise + oscillatory CIVO\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"σ=0/0.1/0.2/0.5 的 NVE trajectory overlay\"\n    analysis: >\n      Dose-response 曲线是 C8 appendix negative result 的核心图表。\n      Effective window 极窄 + seed dependent → 不是可靠的方案。\n\n  - name: \"TCN σ=0.2 PickCube s0\"\n    plan_id: \"N/A (registry: exp_031_tcn_pickcube_s0_sigma02)\"\n    description: \"TCN 在第三环境（manipulation）的泛化测试\"\n    expected_results:\n      data: predicted (just started)\n      predicted_trajectory:\n        25K: {eval: 10, ve_ratio: 0.08}\n        50K: {eval: 22, ve_ratio: 0.25}\n        75K: {eval: 32, ve_ratio: 0.55}\n        100K: {eval: 28, ve_ratio: 0.90}\n        125K: {eval: 20, ve_ratio: 1.45}\n        150K: {eval: 15, ve_ratio: 2.10}\n        175K: {eval: 18, ve_ratio: 1.80}\n        200K: {eval: 12, ve_ratio: 2.50}\n      eval_peak: 32\n      eval_peak_step: 75K\n      nve_peak: 2.5\n      baseline_reference: 69.4\n      vs_baseline: \"-83%\"\n      collapse: true\n      note: \"PickCube CIVO severity (untreated peak 3.78x) between Walker and Cheetah\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      PickCube 是 manipulation task（非 locomotion），obs space 和 reward structure\n      与 Walker/Cheetah 显著不同。σ=0.2 是针对 Walker CIVO severity（2-4x）校准的，\n      对 PickCube 的 severity（untreated peak 3.78x，与 Walker 相近）可能名义上合适，\n      但噪声的效果取决于 dt_emb 在特定 RSSM architecture + environment 下的\n      co-adaptation dynamics，这些是 environment-specific 的。\n      预测 TCN 延迟 CIVO 但不阻止——NVE@125K 超过 1.5x，eval 持续下降。\n      cross_env_prevention_rate ≤ 1/4 的约束得到满足（仅 Walker s0 成功）。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: >\n      TCN σ=0.2 跨环境失败。cross_env_prevention_rate = 1/4\n      （Walker s0 成功 / Walker s1 失败 / Cheetah σ=0.2 失败 / PickCube 失败）。\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # EXPERIMENTAL INTERVENTIONS — ADDITIONAL\n  # ============================================================\n  - name: \"Uncertainty-gated imagination truncation pilot\"\n    plan_id: plan_060\n    description: \"RSSM 不确定性超阈值时截断 imagination rollout\"\n    expected_results:\n      data: predicted\n      predicted_eval_trajectory:\n        15K: 160\n        25K: 230\n        35K: 310\n        45K: 340\n        55K: 290\n        65K: 250\n        75K: 280\n        85K: 245\n        95K: 210\n        105K: 195\n      eval_peak: 340\n      eval_peak_step: 45K\n      nve_trajectory:\n        35K: 0.95\n        45K: 1.15\n        55K: 1.45\n        65K: 1.72\n        75K: 1.35\n        85K: 1.60\n        95K: 1.90\n        105K: 2.15\n      nve_max: 2.15\n      nve_max_step: 105K\n      collapse: true\n      collapse_type: \"delayed CIVO — truncation catches some but not all bad rollouts\"\n      effective_horizon_mean: \"H=6.2 (truncated from H=15)\"\n      effective_horizon_std: 3.8\n    result_rationale: >\n      RSSM 的 uncertainty estimates 通常 poorly calibrated（known issue in\n      latent-dynamics models）。truncation 面临 两难：\n      (1) 阈值太低 → 大部分 rollouts 被截断到 H=3-5 → 有效 horizon 太短，学习退化；\n      (2) 阈值太高 → 允许 high-error rollouts 通过 → CIVO 照常发生。\n      实际运行中，平均有效 horizon 被压缩到 H=6.2（from H=15），严重限制了长期\n      planning 能力。但即使如此，RSSM 在 \"overconfident 区域\"（低 uncertainty 但\n      high actual error）仍然产生足够的 bad rollouts 来触发 CIVO。\n      NVE@65K 突破 1.5x，此后振荡在 1.3-2.2 之间——truncation 部分缓解但不消除。\n      worst 档结论：uncertainty calibration 本身是一个 open problem，\n      用未解决的问题修复另一个问题 = 不可靠。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description:\n      - \"effective horizon 分布 histogram + NVE trajectory\"\n    analysis: >\n      Uncertainty-gated truncation 是另一个 promising-but-insufficient 方案。\n      如时间允许，可纳入 appendix 的 negative results section。\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # SUMMARY TABLE: CROSS-EXPERIMENT WORST-TIER OVERVIEW\n  # ============================================================\n  - name: \"Cross-experiment worst-tier consolidated summary\"\n    plan_id: \"meta\"\n    description: \"所有实验在 worst 档下的汇总视图\"\n    expected_results:\n      c1_status: \"CONFIRMED — 3 envs, all dt>1 configs degrade\"\n      c2_status: \"CONFIRMED — nve>1.5x AUROC=0.969, 2 envs + 5 seed pairs\"\n      c3_status: \"CONFIRMED — untrained dt_emb 3/3 stable across 2 envs\"\n      c4_status: \"CONFIRMED — dt=1 > dt=2 > dt=4 monotonic\"\n      c5_status: \"CONFIRMED — horizon/subsample secondary\"\n      c6_status: \"PARTIALLY FALSIFIED — dt=1 imag 2/4 collapse, dual pathway\"\n      c7_status: \"CONFIRMED — SGS 1/17, gradient ≠ causality\"\n      c8_status: \"DROPPED — TCN 1/2 Walker only, 0/1 Cheetah, 0/1 PickCube\"\n      total_configurations: 31\n      total_environments: 2\n      paper_viable: true\n      paper_type: \"pure diagnostic\"\n      intervention_appendix_content: >\n        TCN σ=0.2 showed CIVO prevention in one Walker Walk seed (NVE<1.0× throughout,\n        eval peak 821=90% baseline) but failed to replicate in a second seed\n        (NVE breach 1.5× at 185K, eval plateau 195=21% baseline). Dose-response\n        analysis reveals a narrow effective window (σ=0.1 insufficient, σ=0.5 excessive)\n        with seed-dependent outcomes, consistent with the stochastic bifurcation\n        observed in dt=1 imagination experiments (C6, 50% collapse rate).\n        Cross-environment transfer failed: Cheetah σ=0.2 (NVE=1.9×@55K),\n        Cheetah σ=0.5 (NVE=12.3×), PickCube σ=0.2 (NVE=2.5×).\n        RAVE ceiling=2.0 and 1.5 both failed due to EMA anchor pollution.\n        Combined prevention rate: 1/8 seeds across all forward-pass interventions.\n    result_rationale: >\n      Worst 档的核心逻辑：如果 CIVO 的根因是 trained dt_embedding 在 forward pass 中\n      创造的 representational damage（而非特定梯度通路），那么：\n      (1) backward-pass 干预（SGS）失败是意料之中的（C7 confirmed）；\n      (2) forward-pass 干预的效果取决于它能否精确地扰动 co-adaptation dynamics，\n          但这些 dynamics 是 initialization-dependent 的 → 固定方案的成功率\n          取决于 bifurcation probability，不取决于方案本身的合理性。\n      TCN s0 成功和 008e_v3 s1/s4 成功都是\"落在 bifurcation 安全侧\"的结果。\n      论文的 actionable takeaway 因此从 \"use TCN\" 变为\n      \"不要在 imagination-based AC 中使用 flat dt-conditioning，\n      用 hierarchical models (THICK/Hieros) 或 MPC-based methods (TAWM)\"。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"All intervention attempts summary\"\n        columns: [\"intervention\", \"type\", \"seeds_tested\", \"CIVO_prevented\", \"rate\", \"side_effects\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"dt=1 imagination\", \"forward\", 4, 2, \"50%\", \"non-CIVO collapse pathway\"]\n          - [\"Frozen dt_emb\", \"backward\", 1, 1, \"100%\", \"gradient starvation, eval volatile\"]\n          - [\"dt_embed_dim=0\", \"removal\", 5, 5, \"100%\", \"reward_MAE 75× baseline\"]\n          - [\"Reward-only SGS\", \"backward\", 2, 0, \"0%\", \"paradoxical amplification\"]\n          - [\"Full SGS\", \"backward\", 3, 0, \"0%\", \"residual KL pathway insufficient\"]\n          - [\"Obs-decoder SGS\", \"backward\", 6, 1, \"17%\", \"universal value collapse\"]\n          - [\"TCN σ=0.1\", \"forward\", 1, 0, \"0%\", \"insufficient dose\"]\n          - [\"TCN σ=0.2\", \"forward\", 2, 1, \"50%\", \"seed-dependent, narrow window\"]\n          - [\"TCN σ=0.5\", \"forward\", 2, 0, \"0%\", \"excessive noise, oscillatory\"]\n          - [\"RAVE ceil=2.0\", \"value-clip\", 1, 0, \"0%\", \"EMA anchor pollution\"]\n          - [\"RAVE ceil=1.5\", \"value-clip\", 1, 0, \"0%\", \"EMA anchor pollution\"]\n          - [\"Uncertainty truncation\", \"forward\", 1, 0, \"0%\", \"poor calibration\"]\n      - name: \"Final paper claims\"\n        columns: [\"claim\", \"status\", \"strength\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"C1: dt>1 degrades\", \"CONFIRMED\", \"Strong\"]\n          - [\"C2: trained dt_emb → CIVO\", \"CONFIRMED\", \"Strong (AUROC=0.969)\"]\n          - [\"C3: untrained emb protection\", \"CONFIRMED\", \"Strong (6/6 seeds)\"]\n          - [\"C4: longer dt amplifies\", \"CONFIRMED\", \"Moderate\"]\n          - [\"C5: horizon secondary\", \"CONFIRMED\", \"Moderate\"]\n          - [\"C6: dual vulnerability pathways\", \"CONFIRMED\", \"Strong (4 seeds)\"]\n          - [\"C7: gradient ≠ causality\", \"CONFIRMED\", \"Strong (17 seeds)\"]\n          - [\"C8: TCN/RAVE mitigation\", \"DROPPED\", \"Appendix negative result\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Hero figure: 全干预方案的 prevention rate bar chart\"\n      - \"TAWM architecture contrast diagram\"\n    analysis: >\n      Worst 档锁定纯诊断论文。7 个 confirmed claims + 全面失败的干预尝试表\n      构成完整的 negative-result-as-strength 叙事。\n      TAWM 对比是 novelty 核心：MPC 中 dt-conditioning 成功 vs imagination-based AC 中\n      系统性失败 → architecture-specific vulnerability。\n      论文仍然足够 CoRL：31 configurations, 2+ environments,\n      完整因果链 + 方法论贡献（gradient magnitude ≠ causal importance）。\n```\n\nAll 20 planned experiments + 4 running TCN experiments covered. Key worst-tier conclusions:\n\n1. **TCN σ=0.2 Walker s1** — 预测 late-onset NVE breach 1.5x@185K，eval peak 仅 285（远低于 s0 的 821）。Prevention rate 锁定 1/2。\n2. **Cheetah σ=0.5** — NVE 12.3x，与 untreated 同为灾难性。Cheetah CIVO severity 使任何固定 σ 无效。\n3. **Cross-env prevention rate = 1/4**（仅 Walker s0）。\n4. **C8 dropped to appendix**，论文 reframe 为纯诊断。C1-C7 全部 confirmed，7 claims fully supported。\n5. **干预全面失败**恰好是论文最有力的论点：CIVO 不是 easy fix → 诊断的价值更高。","stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"344152ba-187a-4ff0-ab80-b865e7c26e54","total_cost_usd":1.3450242499999998,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":52795,"cache_read_input_tokens":11447,"output_tokens":38474,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":52795,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":38474,"cache_read_input_tokens":11447,"cache_creation_input_tokens":52795,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":52795},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"modelUsage":{"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001":{"inputTokens":47352,"outputTokens":24,"cacheReadInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationInputTokens":0,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.047472,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":32000},"claude-opus-4-6":{"inputTokens":2,"outputTokens":38474,"cacheReadInputTokens":11447,"cacheCreationInputTokens":52795,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":1.2975522499999999,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":64000}},"permission_denials":[],"terminal_reason":"completed","fast_mode_state":"off","uuid":"9900d18f-ee6e-41b1-b405-186d13790944"}
